    {
      "number": 185,
      "question_en": "A 12 year-old girl had a slight fever and chills after playing outside. One day later she had a fever, did not want to be covered, had profuse sweating, and constantly wanted cold drinks. On the third day her condition suddenly worsened with increased fever, a rigid neck, an hyperextended spine, a red rash, and had seizures. What is the point prescription for this patient?",
      "question_hant": "一名12歲女孩在戶外玩耍後出現輕微發熱與惡寒。一日後開始發熱，不欲蓋被，大汗淋漓，且不斷想喝冷飲。第三天病情突然加重，發熱加劇，頸項強直，脊背反張，出現紅疹並發生抽搐。此患者應選用何種穴位處方？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "en": "LR-8 (qu quan), KI-3 (tai xi), SP-6 (san yin jiao), DU-16 (feng fu), SI-3 (hou xi), BL-62 (shen mai)",
