    {
      "number": 195,
      "question_en": "A 29 year-old male has a two-year history of lower back pain. He does not report any causative factor. The patient says that his lower back feels cold, painful, and heavy. The back pain worsens during cold or cloudy days and improves with warmth. He reports that sometimes the back pain radiates to the lower abdomen. His appetite is slightly poor and does not experience thirst often. Urine is of normal quantity and yellow. He has bowel movements every 2-3 days, with normal stools. He reports no problems with sleep. The tongue is pale with white and greasy coating. The pulse is sunken and thin. Blood Pressure is 110/68, Pulse 64, Respirations 16, and Temperature 98.6 F. Lumbar spine x-ray is within normal limits. Neurological examination shows deep tendon reflexes are +2/+4 for quadriceps and Achilles. Sensory exam of the lower extremities is within normal limits. He is treated with DU-3 (yao yang guan) and BL-54 (zhi bian). After four treatments the pain was alleviated after each treatment but then quickly returned afterwards. Which of the following prescription would you now choose?",
      "question_hant": "一名29歲男性有兩年下背痛病史，未提及任何誘發因素。患者自述下背部有寒冷、疼痛及沉重感，天氣寒冷或陰天時疼痛加重，得溫則減。他表示疼痛有時會放射至下腹部。食欲略差，不常感到口渴。小便量正常，色黃。大便每2至3日一次，性狀正常。睡眠無異常。舌淡，苔白膩，脈沉細。血壓110/68，脈搏64，呼吸16次，體溫98.6°F。腰椎X光檢查結果正常。神經學檢查顯示股四頭肌與跟腱之深部肌腱反射為+2/+4。下肢感覺檢查正常。患者接受腰陽關與秩邊治療。經四次治療後，疼痛在每次治療後皆有緩解，但隨後又迅速復發。您現在會選用下列哪一組處方？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "en": "DU-3 (yao yang quan), BL-40 (wei zhong), BL-23 (shen shu), DU-26 (ren zhong)",
