    {
      "number": 197,
      "question_en": "A 32 year-old female complains of headache and fever. A week earlier she had a fever of 101.1 F with sweating on and off. She reported that when she sweat the temperature decreased and when the sweating stopped the temperature increased. A week ago, she felt chilled, had nasal obstruction with a watery discharge, and a headache with a heavy sensation. Her limbs were sore and heavy. She said her appetite was poor, felt nauseated, vomited, and was not thirsty. She reports unformed stools with BMs once or twice per day. Urination is normal. The pulse is soft. The tongue coating is white-greasy and a little yellow at the root. Blood pressure 126/84, pulse 84, temperature 100 F. CBC shows Red Blood Count is 5.1, White Blood Count is 10,500 and Basic Metabolic Panel shows electrolytes are within normal limits. Neurological examination found no sensory or deep tendon reflexes. The patient is alert and cooperative. Three acupuncture treatments were given: DU-14 (da zhui), TB-5 (wai guan), GB-20 (feng chi), and DU-9 (zhi yang). The temperature gradually became normal and the headache was resolved but the appetite was still poor. Which prescription would you now select?",
      "question_hant": "一名32歲女性主訴頭痛與發熱。一週前她曾發熱至101.1°F，並時有時無地出汗，她表示流汗時體溫下降，汗止則體溫又上升。一週前她感到畏寒，鼻塞且鼻涕清稀，頭痛伴沉重感，四肢痠痛沉重。她表示食欲不振，噁心並曾嘔吐，不覺口渴。大便不成形，每日一至兩次。小便正常。脈軟，舌苔白膩，舌根略黃。血壓126/84，脈搏84，體溫100°F。全血球計數顯示紅血球數為5.1，白血球數為10,500，基本代謝檢查顯示電解質皆在正常範圍。神經學檢查未發現感覺或深部肌腱反射異常。患者意識清楚，配合檢查。曾接受三次針灸治療：大椎、外關、風池、至陽。體溫已逐漸恢復正常，頭痛亦已緩解，但食欲仍然不振。您現在會選用下列哪一組處方？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "en": "DU-14 (da zhui), TB-5 (wai guan), ST-36 (zu san li)",
