      ],
      "exp_en": "LU-3 is a Window of Heaven point which regulates the ascending and descending of qi to and from the body and the head. Window of Heaven points can subdue rebellious qi and promote the ascending of clear qi to the head. LU-3 can descend Lung qi and ascend the clear qi. The cough and wheezing is due to rebellious Lung qi. Insomnia can be caused by too much qi ascending to the head or due to qi not descending from the head. LU-3 also treats somnolence and forgetfulness which are due to the lack of clear qi ascending to the head. Forgetfulness is an important symptom treated by this point through the stimulation of the ascending of qi of both the Lungs and the Heart. LU-3 also treats \"talking to ghosts\" which is an ancient way of saying serious mental-emotional problems. The actions of LU-3 are to clear Lung heat and descend Lung qi, cool blood and stop bleeding, and calm the corporeal soul (po). A Manual of Acupuncture, Deadman, 2nd Edition, page 78; The Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015 Edition, page 951",
      "exp_hant": "天府（LU-3）是天窗穴之一，能調節身體與頭部之間氣的升降。天窗穴類穴位可平抑逆亂之氣，並促進清氣上升至頭部。天府能使肺氣下降、清氣上升。咳嗽與喘鳴是因肺氣上逆所致。失眠可能是因過多氣上衝頭部，或因氣未能自頭部下降所致。天府亦可治療因清氣未能上達頭部所致的嗜睡與健忘。健忘是此穴所治療的重要症狀之一，透過刺激肺與心兩者氣機的上升而發揮作用。天府亦可治療「言語如見鬼」，這是古代對嚴重精神情志問題的一種說法。天府的作用為清肺熱、降肺氣、涼血止血，並安魄。《針灸大成手冊》，Deadman著，第2版，第78頁；《中醫基礎學》(The Foundations of Chinese Medicine)，Maciocia著，2015年版，第951頁"
    },
