      "exp_en": "Small Intestine Deficient and Cold. The treatment principle is to Expel Cold, Warm Intestines, Tonify Spleen Yang. Moxa on ginger on REN-6 (qi hai) specifically treats deficient-cold in the intestines. ST-25 (tian shu) stops diarrhea and abdominal pain. ST-39 (xia ju xu) is specific for alleviating abdominal pain. Moxa on ST-36 (zu san li) strengthens the yang and expels the cold. BL-20 (pi shu) strengthens Spleen yang. BL-27 (xiao chang shu) expels cold from the Small Intestine. Reinforcing needle technique is used. Moxa is applicable. The Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015, page 684; 2005 Edition, page 643; 1989 Edition page 276",
      "exp_hant": "小腸虛寒。治療原則為祛寒、溫腸、補脾陽。隔薑灸氣海（REN-6）專治腸道虛寒。天樞（ST-25）止瀉止腹痛。下巨虛（ST-39）專門用於緩解腹痛。艾灸足三里（ST-36）可壯陽祛寒。脾俞（BL-20）健脾陽。小腸俞（BL-27）祛小腸之寒。採用補法針刺，可配合艾灸。《中醫基礎學》，Maciocia著，2015年版，第684頁；2005年版，第643頁；1989年版，第276頁"
