      "exp_en": "The 8-Principles diagnosis is Internal and Channel-Collateral, Cold, Excess. The etiology is Retention of Dampness. According to channel pattern, the diagnosis is Shao Yang Channel Obstruction. The organ pattern is Retention of Dampness in Spleen and Stomach. The treatment principle is to Remove Dampness from the Middle Jiao and Resolve Shao Yang Channel Obstruction. Tai yang is local point that regulates the qi and blood and is often used in the treatment of headaches and dizziness. GB-20 regulates the qi and blood of the shao yang channel. TB-5 removes channel obstruction and treats symptoms of the head of the shao yang channel. REN-12 regulates the qi of the middle burner and helps to remove dampness. SP-9 tonifies the Spleen and removes dampness. ST-36 strengthens the middle burner and regulates qi. DU-20 can calm the spirit independent of the reason (heat, wind, dampness, phlegm, or excess yang). DU-20 is indicated when there are Spirit problems associated with head and brain symptoms. Though HT-5 can calm the spirit, its focus is on emotional disturbances rather than problems with sleep or memory. HT-6, the xi-cleft point, is indicated more for heart pain. And issues with night sweats. LR-2, the ying-spring point, is indicated more for clearing Liver fire which is not part of the diagnosis. BP, respiration, heart rate, and body temperature are normal. As for the MRI result, contrast material can be used to enhance the appearance of certain detail of the brain. Acupuncture Patterns and Practice, Eastland Press, 1993, Xuemai and Jingyi, Pages 71-74",
      "exp_hant": "八綱辨證為裡證、經絡證、寒證、實證。病因為濕邪停滯。依經絡辨證，診斷為少陽經受阻。臟腑辨證為脾胃濕滯。治療原則為祛除中焦濕邪、疏通少陽經阻滯。太陽穴為局部穴，能調理局部氣血，常用於治療頭痛與眩暈。風池（GB-20）調理少陽經氣血。外關（TB-5）疏通經絡阻滯，並治療少陽經頭部症狀。中脘（REN-12）調理中焦之氣，有助祛濕。陰陵泉（SP-9）健脾祛濕。足三里（ST-36）強壯中焦、調氣。百會（DU-20）能安神，不論病因為何（熱、風、濕、痰或陽亢皆可）。當出現與頭部及腦部症狀相關的神志問題時，適合選用百會。雖然通里（HT-5）亦能安神，但其重點在於情志方面的擾動，而非睡眠或記憶問題。陰郄（HT-6）為心經郄穴，較適用於心痛及盜汗方面的問題。行間（LR-2）為滎穴，較適用於清肝火，而此並非本病案的辨證重點。血壓、呼吸、心率與體溫皆正常。至於MRI結果，顯影劑可用於增強腦部某些細節的顯像。《針灸模式與臨床實踐》(Acupuncture Patterns and Practice)，Eastland Press出版，1993年，血脈與經義篇，第71-74頁"
