    {
      "number": 238,
      "question_en": "For which conditions is moxibustion with salt best used?",
      "question_hant": "隔鹽灸最適合用於治療下列哪些病症？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "en": "scrofula, TB, early stages of skin ulcer with boils",
          "hant": "瘰癧、肺癆、皮膚潰瘍及癤腫初期",
