    {
      "number": 242,
      "question_en": "The Extraordinary Vessels have a direct association with",
      "question_hant": "奇經八脈與下列何者有直接關聯？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "en": "all the Yin organs (zang)",
          "hant": "所有陰臟（臟）",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "en": "all the Yang organs (fu)",
          "hant": "所有陽腑（腑）",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "en": "the Extraordinary Yang organs",
          "hant": "奇恆之腑",
          "correct": true
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "en": "the Extraordinary Yin organs",
          "hant": "奇恆之臟",
          "correct": false
        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "The six Extraordinary Yang organs are the Uterus, Brain, Bones, Marrow, Gall Bladder, and Blood Vessels. They are extraordinary because they store substances (marrow, bile, blood, etc) similar to the yin organs and are hollow like the yang organs. There is no such thing as the Extraordinary Yin Organs. The Extraordinary Vessels do not have a direct connection or association with the zang fu. The Extraordinary Vessels indirectly connect to the zang fu through the Kidneys which are the source of yin and yang of all the zang fu. However, the Extraordinary Vessels all have a direct relationship to the Extraordinary Yang organs. The Brain is associated with the Governing and Yin-Yang Stepping Vessels. The Uterus is associated with the Penetrating and Directing Vessels. The Blood Vessels are associated with the Penetrating Vessel. The Gall Bladder is associated with the Girdle Vessel. The Bones are associated with the Penetrating, Governing, and Directing Vessels. Marrow is associated with the Governing and Penetrating Vessels. The Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015, page 235, 871-872",
      "exp_hant": "六個奇恆之腑分別為子宮、腦、骨、髓、膽與脈（血脈）。之所以稱為「奇恆」，是因為它們如陰臟一般儲藏精微物質（髓、膽汁、血等），但形態中空又如陽腑一般。並不存在所謂「奇恆之臟」。奇經八脈與臟腑之間並無直接的聯繫或關聯，而是透過腎——作為一身陰陽之根本——間接與臟腑相連。然而，奇經八脈皆與奇恆之腑有直接的關係：腦與督脈及陰陽蹻脈相關；子宮與衝脈及任脈相關；脈（血脈）與衝脈相關；膽與帶脈相關；骨與衝脈、督脈及任脈相關；髓與督脈及衝脈相關。《中醫基礎學》，Maciocia著，2015年版，第235、871-872頁"
    },
    {
      "number": 243,
      "question_en": "A 32 year-old female patient had painful periods for the past two years. The pain was in the hypogastrium area, sacrum, and the lateral abdomen. The pain was dull with a bearing down sensation. She reported that her periods were regular with blood a little dark. She also had PMS with breast and abdominal distention associated with irritability. She reported that she had been on the birth control pill for ten years. The periods became painful when she stopped the pill. To help with the pain, she was prescribed progesterone pill but it was of no help with the menstrual pain. Her other health problems included IBS (irritable bowel syndrome) with spastic abdominal pain and diarrhea alternating with constipation. On questioning, she reported blurry vision and dizziness. The tongue was slightly orangey on the sides. The pulse was fine on the right side and fine-wiry on the left side. The treatment given was from a list of points that included LU-7 (lie que) on the right side, KI-6 (zhao hai) on the left side, and (bilaterally) LI-4 (he gu), LR-3 (tai chong), and ST-29 (gui lai). After being treated through three menstrual cycles, she reported that her breast and abdominal distention and irritability were gradually improving. The strong period pain was lessened but the dull pain with a bearing down sensation was not changed. She also reported having fewer IBS symptoms. The pulse on the left side was fine but less wiry than before. Which points would you add to the prescription?",
      "question_hant": "一名32歲女性患者過去兩年來經痛，疼痛部位在小腹、骶部及腹側，痛感悶脹並伴有下墜感。她表示月經週期規律，經血顏色略暗。她也有經前症候群，出現乳房與腹部脹痛並伴隨易怒。她表示已服用避孕藥十年，停藥後開始出現經痛。為緩解疼痛，她被開立黃體酮藥物，但對經痛並無幫助。她的其他健康問題包括腸躁症（IBS），出現痙攣性腹痛及腹瀉與便秘交替。經詢問後，她表示有視物模糊與頭暈的情形。舌兩側略帶橙色。右脈細，左脈細弦。所給予的治療處方包括右側列缺（LU-7）、左側照海（KI-6），以及雙側合谷（LI-4）、太衝（LR-3）與歸來（ST-29）。經過三個月經週期的治療後，她表示乳房與腹部脹痛及易怒逐漸改善，劇烈經痛減輕，但悶痛伴下墜感並未改變。她也表示腸躁症症狀減少。左側脈仍細，但弦象較先前減弱。您會在處方中加入哪些穴位？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "en": "replace LU-7 (lie que) and KI-6 (zhao hai) with SP-4 (gong sun), PC-6 (nei guan), and SP-14 (fu jie)",
