          "key": "D",
          "en": "ST-36 (zu san li), SP-6 (san yin jiao), REN-4 (guan yuan)",
          "hant": "足三里、三陰交、關元",
          "correct": true
        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "The clinical picture was due to two patterns: Liver Qi Stasis and Liver Blood Deficiency. Liver Qi Stasis generated PMS, irritability, breast-abdominal distention, painful periods, IBS, and wiry pulse on the left. The Blood Deficiency generated dull menstrual pain, dizziness, blurry vision, orangey color on the side of the tongue, and fine pulse. The sequence of events was most likely birth control pills creating Liver Blood Deficiency which in turn produced Liver Qi Stasis. The original prescription focused on the Liver Qi Stasis and regulating the Directing Vessel. LU-7 and KI-6 strengthen the Uterus and harmonizes the Directing Vessel. LI-4 and LR-3 regulate the ascending and descending of qi. LR-3 pacifies the Liver and moves the qi. ST-29 moves qi and blood and stops pain. The treatment improved the Liver Qi Stasis but did not address the Liver Blood Deficiency. ST-36 and SP-6 tonify the qi and blood. REN-4 nourish the Blood and strengthens the Uterus. The Rx with SP-8 focuses on moving blood. The Rx with SP-4 focuses on regulating the Penetrating Vessel and regulating-moving blood. The Rx with SP-9 focuses on transforming Dampness. Obstetrics and Gynecology in Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 1998, page 240",
      "exp_hant": "此臨床表現源自兩個證型：肝氣鬱結與肝血虛。肝氣鬱結導致經前症候群、易怒、乳房與腹部脹痛、經痛及腸躁症，並使左脈呈弦象。血虛則導致悶痛型經痛、頭暈、視物模糊、舌側橙色以及脈細。整個病程的發展順序很可能是避孕藥先導致肝血虛，進而產生肝氣鬱結。原本的處方著重於疏解肝氣鬱結並調理任脈：列缺與照海強壯子宮並調和任脈；合谷與太衝調理氣的升降，太衝平肝行氣；歸來行氣活血止痛。此治療改善了肝氣鬱結，但並未處理肝血虛的部分。足三里與三陰交補益氣血；關元養血並強壯子宮。含地機的處方著重於活血；含公孫的處方著重於調理衝脈及調血活血；含陽陵泉的處方則著重於化濕。《中醫婦產科學》(Obstetrics and Gynecology in Chinese Medicine)，Maciocia著，1998年版，第240頁"
