      "exp_en": "This is the best answer. Blood pressure is a little high but not something to be concerned about in terms of a same day referral. This patient most likely has a lower respiratory tract infection (LRTI) that affects the bronchi which is the area of the lung that exchanges carbon dioxide for oxygen. In an LRTI the bronchi narrow. Breathlessness is a respiratory rate of greater than 30 breaths per minute. Breathlessness is a key part of a LRTI. It is a red flag especially in the elderly with an infection, immunocompromised patients or patients with a pre-existing lung disorder (asthma, chronic bronchitis, emphysema, cancer). All patients with breathlessness (greater than 30 bpm) caused by an infection in the lungs should be referred as an urgent (same day) or high priority (911) referral depending on the severity of the symptoms and signs. In the elderly breathlessness may be the only sign of an LRTI. Normal respiratory rate in a an adult is 10 to 20 breaths per minute (one inhalation exhalation). Moderate breathlessness is more than 30 breaths per minute (bpm). Severe breathlessness is more than 60 bpm. The Complementary Therapist's Guide to Red Flag Referrals, Stephenson, 2013, page 37, 166",
      "exp_hant": "此為最佳答案。血壓略高，但就當日轉診而言並非需要特別擔心的項目。此患者很可能罹患下呼吸道感染（LRTI），影響支氣管——即肺部進行二氧化碳與氧氣交換的部位。下呼吸道感染會使支氣管變窄。呼吸困難是指呼吸速率超過每分鐘30次，是下呼吸道感染的重要表現之一，屬於警示徵象，尤其是在有感染的老年人、免疫功能低下患者，或有既有肺部疾病（氣喘、慢性支氣管炎、肺氣腫、癌症）的患者身上更需留意。所有因肺部感染而出現呼吸困難（超過每分鐘30次）的患者，皆應依症狀與徵象的嚴重程度轉診為緊急（當日）或高優先（撥打911）轉診。在老年患者中，呼吸困難可能是下呼吸道感染唯一的表現。成人正常呼吸速率為每分鐘10至20次（一次吸氣呼氣）。中度呼吸困難為每分鐘超過30次，重度呼吸困難則為每分鐘超過60次。《輔助療法從業者紅旗轉診指南》，Stephenson著，2013年版，第37、166頁"
