    {
      "number": 268,
      "question_en": "A 36 year-old male has a two year history of insomnia which has worsened during the past month as he has been preparing for the California acupuncture exam. He easily falls asleep but he is often awakened by his dreams of failing the exam and then finds it difficult falling asleep again. He often feels restless during sleep. When the restlessness worsens he feels has a hot, feverish sensation and when he runs his hand through his hair, he discovers that he has been sweating. When he awakes he feels dizzy, has a heavy head sensation, and has high-frequency tinnitus. He complains that he has difficulty remembering the material he is studying. He also reports that he generally feels weak, feels cold almost all of the time, and has cold hands and feet. He says that his body has a difficult time adapting to temperature changes, to which he is very sensitive. He has a poor appetite with difficulty digesting his food. His mouth is dry and likes to drink lots of water. He has frequent urination and gets up 3-4 times per night to urinate. His stools are loose. He says that he has cold and painful knees. His complexion is pale. The tongue is dark red with a yellow, dry, greasy coating which is thick in the middle and back of the tongue. The right pulse is slippery and forceless with the proximal position being thin. The left pulse is sunken, slippery, and forceless. Blood pressure is 120/80, Pulse 70, Respirations 18, and Temperature 98.6 F. Blood sugar is 99, TSH is 1.98 mu/mL, and PSA is 3.0. After seven treatments of BL-23 (shen shu), KI-3 (tai xi), REN-4 (guan yuan), REN-6 (qi hai), he reports that his urinary frequency has decreased, he feels a little less but still hot at night, and less back pain but he still has problems with insomnia particularly with excess dreaming (which have increased in frequency), loose stools, and dizziness in the morning. What would you do now?",
      "question_hant": "一名36歲男性有兩年的失眠病史，過去一個月因準備加州針灸考試而加重。他容易入睡，但常因夢見考試不及格而驚醒，之後便難以再度入睡。他睡眠時常感到不安穩，不安加重時會感到燥熱，用手撥頭髮時發現已經出汗。醒來時他感到頭暈、頭重，並有高頻耳鳴。他主訴難以記住正在研讀的內容。他也表示整體感覺虛弱，幾乎一直怕冷，手腳冰冷。他說自己身體難以適應溫度變化，對此十分敏感。他食慾不振，消化不良。口乾喜多飲。小便頻繁，夜間需起床解尿3至4次。大便稀溏。他表示膝蓋冰冷疼痛。面色蒼白。舌質暗紅，苔黃、乾、膩，舌中後部苔厚。右脈滑而無力，寸部細；左脈沉、滑而無力。血壓120/80，脈搏70，呼吸18，體溫98.6華氏度。血糖99，TSH為1.98 mu/mL，PSA為3.0。以腎俞（BL-23）、太谿（KI-3）、關元（REN-4）、氣海（REN-6）治療七次後，他表示小便頻率已減少，夜間燥熱感稍減但仍存在，腰痛減輕，但失眠問題仍未改善，尤其是多夢的情形（發作頻率增加）、大便稀溏，以及晨起頭暈。您現在會怎麼做？",
