          "en": "SP-15 (da heng), REN-6 (qi hai), PC-3 (qu ze), extra point an mian, HT-9 (shao chong), SP-1 (yin bai)",
          "hant": "大橫、氣海、曲澤、安眠（經外奇穴）、少衝、隱白",
          "correct": true
