      ],
      "exp_en": "The 8-Principles diagnosis is Internal, Hot above and Cold below, Deficient. The organ pattern is Deficient Heart Blood and Yin with Deficient Spleen and Kidney Yang. The first prescription focused solely on tonifying the Kidneys which addressed some of the symptoms but not the total picture. The focus then changed to the remaining symptoms arising from the Heart and Spleen. SP-15 tonfies the Spleen and removes excess Dampness that results from Spleen qi or yang xu. It also helps in the treatment of loose stools. REN-6 strengthens Kidney qi and is a major tonification point. It also secondarily regulates the qi of the whole body. PC-3 removes Heart channel obstruction, improves qi circulation, and clears heat. The extra point an mian treats dizziness and insomnia. HT-9 calms the Spirit. SP-1 regulates the Spleen and Blood. The combination of HT-9 and SP-1, both jing-well points, together calm the Spirit and alleviate dream-disturbed sleep arising from a disharmony between the Heart and Spleen. The prescription with ST-40 focuses solely on the middle burner and Phlegm removal. It fails to directly address the Heart and Kidney patterns. Just adding GB-20 and the extra point an mian would help with the dizziness and calming the Spirit but fails to address the Spleen pattern involved in this case. Adding BL-15 to the original prescription still keeps the focus on only treating the Kidney and Heart, ignoring the Spleen component. Vital signs (BP, pulse rate, respiration, and body temp) were within normal limits. TSH (Thyroid Stimulating Hormone) was also within normal range which is between 0.5 and 4.0 mu/mL. Blood glucose is also with normal range (normal is less than 100 mg/dL after fasting for at least 8 hours). Most labs considered PSA (Prostate-specific Antigen) levels of 4.0 ng/mL and lower as normal. Acupuncture Patterns and Practice, Eastland Press, 1993, Xuemai and Jingyi, Pages 159-163",
      "exp_hant": "八綱辨證為裡證、上熱下寒、虛證。臟腑辨證為心血心陰虛，兼脾腎陽虛。第一階段處方僅著重於補腎，雖改善部分症狀，但未涵蓋整體病情。因此治療重點轉向處理由心脾所致的殘餘症狀。大橫（SP-15）健脾並袪除因脾氣或脾陽虛所生之濕邪，亦有助於治療大便稀溏。氣海（REN-6）強壯腎氣，是重要的補益要穴，亦能次要地調理全身之氣。曲澤（PC-3）疏通心經阻滯，促進氣機運行並清熱。經外奇穴安眠治療頭暈與失眠。少衝（HT-9）安神。隱白（SP-1）調理脾與血。少衝與隱白皆為井穴，兩者合用能安神，並緩解因心脾不和所致的多夢擾眠。含豐隆的處方僅著重於中焦與化痰，未能直接處理心腎的證型。僅加入風池與經外奇穴安眠雖有助於改善頭暈與安神，卻未能處理此病案中涉及的脾臟證型。在原處方中加入心俞，仍僅侷限於治療心腎，而忽略了脾的部分。生命徵象（血壓、脈率、呼吸與體溫）皆在正常範圍內。TSH（促甲狀腺激素）亦在0.5至4.0 mu/mL的正常範圍內。血糖亦在正常範圍內（空腹至少8小時後正常值應低於100 mg/dL）。大多數檢驗機構將PSA（攝護腺特異性抗原）數值4.0 ng/mL以下視為正常。《針灸模式與臨床實踐》，Eastland Press出版，1993年，血脈與經義篇，第159-163頁"
    },
