      ],
      "exp_en": "For pregnancy, Bensky and CAM have a general contraindication not to use cupping on the lower back and abdomen. CAM lists sacral area instead of lower back. The cupping book by Chirali, however, clarifies that cupping should generally not be used during pregnancy on the lower back and abdomen but notes that cupping can be done on the lower back using light or medium suction up until the sixth month of pregnancy. Cupping should not be applied during a long fast which can weaken the body. It is contraindicated in patients who have any type of bleeding disorder. The CNT manual advises to not cup over an active skin lesion, moles, swelling, trauma, inflammation, infection, or burns (including sunburn). Screen patients for history of reactive skin lesions such as keloid scarring. A keloid scar is a thick type of scar which has an irregular shape and which rises way above the level of the skin and moves beyond the boundaries of the original wound. The practitioner needs to take a thorough history which includes bleeding disorders and medication history before applying cupping treatment. Practitioners need to take a thorough history to identify diabetes, neuropathies or other conditions that might limit the patient from responding to pain when using fire cupping. Have a plan if the paitent has pain when using fire cupping. Cupping Therapy, 2nd Edition, Chirali, page 208; Acupuncture: A Comprehensive Text, Bensky, 1981, page 447; CAM, 2010, page 369",
      "exp_hant": "關於懷孕期間，Bensky與CAM均將下背部與腹部列為拔罐的一般禁忌部位，CAM記載的是骶部而非下背部。然而，Chirali所著的拔罐專書則進一步說明，懷孕期間一般不應於下背部與腹部施行拔罐，但也指出在懷孕六個月以內，可於下背部以輕度或中度吸力施行拔罐。長期禁食期間不應施行拔罐，因其可能使身體虛弱。任何類型的出血性疾病患者皆為拔罐禁忌。CNT手冊建議不應在活動性皮膚病灶、痣、腫脹、外傷、發炎、感染或燒傷（包括曬傷）部位施行拔罐。應篩檢患者是否有反應性皮膚病灶病史，例如蟹足腫瘢痕。蟹足腫是一種增厚型疤痕，形狀不規則，明顯高於皮膚表面，且會超出原本傷口的邊界。執業者在施行拔罐治療前，須詳細詢問病史，包括出血性疾病與用藥史。執業者也應詳細詢問病史，以確認患者是否有糖尿病、神經病變或其他可能影響患者對火罐疼痛反應的狀況，並在患者於施行火罐時感到疼痛時，備有應對計畫。《拔罐療法》(Cupping Therapy)，第2版，Chirali著，第208頁；《針灸全書》，Bensky著，1981年版，第447頁；CAM，2010年版，第369頁"
