      "exp_en": "Extra point sifeng is located on the palmar side of the hand and at the midpoints of the transverse crease of the proximal interphalangeal joints of the four fingers (not including thumb). This point is pricked and squeezed until a yellow-white fluid appears. This point is selected to treat childhood nutritional disorders, childhood diarrhea, and whooping cough. It treats childhood nutritional disorders such as emaciation, sallow complexion, impaired digestion, exhaustion, and enlarged abdomen. It also treats digestive accumulation disorders corresponding to symptoms of food stagnation. The other extra points are also pricked and bled. The extra point shixuan is located at the tip of the fingers and thumb and is almost exclusively selected to treat acute loss of consciousness, epilepsy, and stroke. The extra point haiquan is located in the mouth at the center of the frenulum of the tongue between the points jinjin and yuye. The extra point jinjin and yuye is located on the veins on either side of the frenelum of the tongue. In addition to tongue disorders, jin jin and yuye and haiquan treat wasting and thirsting disorder, vomiting, nausea, and diarrhea. A Manual of Acupuncture, Deadman, 2011, page 570, 579",
      "exp_hant": "經外奇穴四縫位於手掌側，四指（不含拇指）近端指間關節橫紋中點處。此穴以點刺法施術，並擠壓至出現黃白色液體為止。此穴用於治療小兒疳積、小兒腹瀉及百日咳。可治療消瘦、面色萎黃、消化不良、疲憊及腹部脹大等小兒疳積症狀，亦可治療對應食積症狀的消化積滯病症。其餘經外奇穴亦以點刺放血施術。十宣位於手指與拇指指尖，幾乎專用於治療急性昏迷、癲癇及中風。海泉位於口腔內，舌繫帶中央、金津與玉液兩穴之間。金津玉液則位於舌繫帶兩側之靜脈上。除舌部病症外，金津玉液與海泉亦可治療消渴、嘔吐、噁心及腹瀉。(出處：A Manual of Acupuncture，Deadman，2011年，第570、579頁)"
