      "exp_en": "This is the most complete and accurate answer. The ear Liver point is located on the cymba concha. Bensky describes the location of the Liver point as being above the Left Hepatomegaly area which is above the Relax Muscles point which is posterior to the Stomach point (where the helix crus \"disappears\"). The Heart point is located on the center of the cavum conchae. The Lung points are located directly above and below the Heart point. CAM describes the Liver point as at the posterior area of the Stomach and Duodenum. The Spleen point is located inferior to the Liver point at the lateral aspect of the cavum concha. Bensky describes the location of the Spleen point as between the Blood point (below Spleen and level with Cervical vertebrae) and the right hepatomegaly area, in the cavum conchae. CAM, 3rd Edition, page 521; CAM 4th Edition, page 427; Bensky, 1981, page 488",
      "exp_hant": "此為最完整且正確的答案。耳穴肝點位於耳甲艇。Bensky將肝點描述為位於「肝腫大左」區之上方，該區則位於「鬆肌」點之上方，「鬆肌」點又位於胃點（耳輪腳消失處）之後方。心點位於耳甲腔正中央。肺點則分別位於心點的正上方與正下方。CAM將肝點描述為位於胃與十二指腸區之後方。脾點位於肝點下方、耳甲腔外側處。Bensky則將脾點描述為位於血點（脾點下方、與頸椎同高處）與「肝腫大右」區之間、耳甲腔內。(出處：CAM，第3版，第521頁；CAM，第4版，第427頁；Bensky，1981年，第488頁)"
