    {
      "number": 330,
      "question_en": "A 27 year-old female has been diagnosed with peripheral neuropathy affecting the upper limb only. The acupuncturist is treating her with ear acupuncture with the Shoulder, Elbow, and Wrist points. She is not showing improvement. What ear points should be added to the prescription?",
      "question_hant": "一名27歲女性被診斷為僅侵犯上肢的周邊神經病變。鍼灸師以耳穴肩、肘、腕點為其治療，但未見改善。應在處方中加入下列哪些耳穴？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "en": "Cervical, Adrenal",
          "hant": "頸椎、腎上腺",
          "correct": false
