        {
          "key": "D",
          "en": "Nerve, Occiput",
          "hant": "神經、枕",
          "correct": false
        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "In this case it is inadequate to only choose ear points that affect the symptomatic body area (Shoulder, Elbow, Wrist). It is also necessary to include points which have a more systemic analgesic effect such as the Sympathetic ear point (location: at intersection of superior border of the inferior crux of antihelix and the medial border of helix) has a strong analgesic and relaxing effect on the internal organs. The ear point Neurogate or Shen Men (location: triangular fossa, medial and superior to the Pelvic Cavity ear point) also has a strong sedative and analgesic effect. The Adrenal point (prominence on inferior part of tragus) stimulates adrenalin release and would be selected to regulate the dilation/constriction of blood vessels, hyper/hypotension, skin diseases, allergies, shock, and inflammation. This point is combined with the Cervical point which is not needed as the patient' s pain only affects the upper limb. The Nerve point (inner wall of antitragus, below and posterior to the Excitation point) treats facial paralysis, severe muscle weakness, and occulomotor paralysis. The Occiput point (posterior and superior part of antitragus) is used for neuropsychiatric disorders, convulsions, lockjaw, neck stiffness, skin disease, and preventing motion sickness. The Subcortex point (anterior side of inner wall antitragus) treats neuropsychiatric disorders, inflammation, and pain. It could be selected but is a bad selection for this case when paired with the Excitation point (inner wall of antitragus below Testicles point) which treats narcolepsy, depression, and emotional withdrawal. Acupuncture A Comprehensive Text, Bensky, 1981, page 613",
      "exp_hant": "此案例中，僅選用對應症狀部位（肩、肘、腕）的耳穴並不足夠，還須加入具全身性止痛效果的耳穴，例如交感點（位於對耳輪下腳上緣與耳輪內緣交會處），對內臟具有強力的鎮痛與放鬆作用。耳穴神門（位於三角窩內，盆腔點內上方）亦具有強烈的鎮靜與止痛效果。腎上腺點（位於耳屏下部隆起處）能刺激腎上腺素分泌，可用於調節血管收縮舒張、高低血壓、皮膚病、過敏、休克及發炎等。此穴常與頸椎點合用，但本案患者疼痛僅侷限於上肢，故不需選用頸椎點。神經點（位於對耳屏內側壁，興奮點下方偏後）用於治療面癱、重度肌無力及動眼神經麻痺。枕點（位於對耳屏後上部）用於神經精神疾患、驚厥、牙關緊閉、頸部僵硬、皮膚病，以及預防暈車暈船。皮質下點（位於對耳屏內側壁前方）用於神經精神疾患、發炎及疼痛，本可選用，但若與興奮點（位於對耳屏內側壁、睪丸點下方）搭配則不適合本案，因興奮點主治嗜睡症、憂鬱及情感淡漠退縮。(出處：Acupuncture A Comprehensive Text，Bensky，1981年，第613頁)"
