      ],
      "exp_en": "The 8-Principles diagnosis is Exterior and Interior, Cold, and Deficient. The etiology is Invasion of Superficial Tissues by Pathogenic Wind. The treatment principle is to Expel Pathogenic Wind, Tonify Yang and Resolve Interior Cold. According to yin yang theory, the diagnosis is Yang Deficiency. Treatment first focused on tonifying the anti-pathogenic qi and resolving the exterior. ST-36 strengthens the yang qi of the whole body and tonifies and harmonizes the middle burner. REN-6 tonifies yang qi and strengthens the Kidneys. The first three treatments focused on strengthening the qi of the body. When moxa is used on REN-6 and ST-36 the yang qi is tonified thereby strengthening the qi to control the pores. TB-5 improves qi circulation on the body surface helping to expel pathogenic wind. BL-12 expels external wind, relieves exterior patterns, and regulates qi of the tai yang channel. Together TB-5 and BL-12 effectively expel wind-cold from the surface of the body. The treatment was effective at resolving the exterior. The second set of points focused on continuing to strengthen the weak anti-pathogenic qi (zheng zi or upright qi) with ST-36 and REN-6. LU-9, the earth, shu-stream and tonification point, is selected to strengthen the Lung to better resist external pathogenic factors. The other prescriptions contain points (BL-12, TB-5, LU-7) which expel external pathogenic wind, which is no longer needed. The physical western exam and lab tests all returned normal values. Acupuncture Patterns and Practice, Eastland Press, 1993, Xuemai and Jingyi, Pages 10-13",
      "exp_hant": "八綱辨證為表裡同病、寒證、虛證。病因為風邪侵襲肌表。治療原則為祛風、補陽、散內寒。依陰陽理論，此為陽虛證。治療首先著重於扶正氣、解表。足三里能強壯全身陽氣，補益並調和中焦。氣海能補陽氣、強腎。前三次治療著重於增強機體正氣。灸氣海與足三里能補陽氣，進而增強固表衛外之氣。外關能改善體表氣血循環，助祛風邪。風門祛風解表，調理太陽經之氣。外關與風門合用，能有效祛除體表之風寒，此階段治療已成功解表。第二組穴位則持續以足三里與氣海強化虛弱的正氣。太淵為土穴、輸穴亦為補穴，選用以強肺，使肺更能抵禦外邪。其餘處方所含之風門、外關、列缺等穴用於祛除外風，此階段已不再需要。西醫理學檢查及實驗室檢查數值皆為正常。(出處：Acupuncture Patterns and Practice，Eastland Press，1993年，Xuemai and Jingyi，第10-13頁)"
    },
