      "exp_en": "The base prescription for insufficient lactation is ST-18, REN-17, and SI-1 which can all be used whether the insufficient lactation or other breast problem is caused by deficiency or excess. ST-18 is a local point that benefits and regulates the qi and blood of the breast as a whole. ST-18 can be used in any breast problem whether caused by deficiency of the Stomach and Spleen Qi or due to an excess condition (Liver qi stasis, Stomach Fire, external pathogenic heat). REN-17 regulates the chest qi, unbinds the chest, benefits the breast (distention, abscess, painful breast) , and promotes lactation. Being between the breasts, REN-17 is a main point to treat an insufficiency in lactation. If the breast disorder is unilateral, the qi sensation from needling REN-17 is directed toward the affected breast. If the breast disorder is bilateral, the qi sensation and needle is directed first to one breast and then the other. REN-17 is often combined with SI-1 which also benefits the breast and promotes lactation. The Small Intestine channel meets with the REN channel at REN-17. The supplemental points, ST-36 and SP-6, were originally chosen thinking that the patient had a deficient qi condition. As this did not resolve the issue, the focus shifts to seeing the problem arising from Liver Qi stagnation (swollen and distended breasts). In addition to the base points, LR-3 and LR-14 were added to move the stagnant Liver qi to restore the free flow of milk. PC-6 could also have been added to the prescription to further regulate and smooth the chest qi. CAM, 3rd Edition, page 485; CAM, 4th Edition, page 588",
      "exp_hant": "治療乳汁不足的基礎處方為乳根、膻中及少澤，無論乳汁不足或其他乳房病症屬虛證或實證，皆可選用此組穴位。乳根為局部穴，能整體調理並改善乳房之氣血，無論病因是脾胃氣虛，或是實證（肝氣鬱滯、胃火、外感邪熱），皆可使用。膻中能調理胸中之氣、寬胸、利乳房（脹痛、乳癰、乳房疼痛），並促進泌乳。因位於兩乳之間，膻中是治療乳汁不足的主穴。若乳房病症為單側，鍼刺膻中的針感應導向患側乳房；若為雙側，則應先導向一側再導向另一側。膻中常與少澤合用，少澤同樣能利乳房並促進泌乳，小腸經即在膻中處與任脈相交會。輔助穴位足三里與三陰交，原本是考量患者屬氣虛證而選用；由於未能解決問題，焦點轉向認為病因為肝氣鬱滯（乳房腫脹脹滿）。在基礎穴位之外，加入太衝與期門以疏通鬱滯之肝氣，恢復乳汁暢通。內關亦可加入處方中，以進一步調暢胸中之氣。(出處：CAM，第3版，第485頁；CAM，第4版，第588頁)"
