      "exp_en": "Suspect the presence of sha when there is pain anywhere in the body. When external pathogens overwhelm the wei qi, then their penetration can stagnate the local qi, blood, and fluids in the channels. Unless resolved, the stagnation can stay longer locally or penetrate deeper. Also, because of the connection of the interior to the exterior, any disorders warrants checking for stagnation manifesting on the surface of the body. The resolution of sha may not completely cure the problem but it will almost always help. Gua Sha, Nielsen, 2009, page 53",
