      "exp_en": "Morning sickness can be due to deficiency in the Spleen and Stomach or due to a disharmony between the Liver and Stomach. The base prescription for morning sickness is ST-36, PC-6, and REN-12. ST-36 harmonizes the Stomach and descends Stomach qi. PC-6 quells the adverse flow of Stomach qi. REN-12 harmonizes the Stomach. This prescription overlooks the involvement of the Liver which the eye distention points to. LR-3 is added to soothe the Liver qi and to stop the Liver from attacking the Stomach. The other points would be part of the prescription for morning sickness due to a deficient Stomach and Spleen. CAM, 3rd Edition, page 482; CAM, 4th Edition, page 585",
      "exp_hant": "孕吐可能源於脾胃虛弱，也可能因肝胃不和所致。孕吐的基本處方為足三里、內關、中脘。足三里能和胃降逆；內關能平降胃氣上逆；中脘能和胃。此基本處方未考量到肝的因素，而眼部脹感正指向肝的問題，因此加入太衝以疏肝理氣、防止肝木犯胃。其餘選項的穴位則屬於因脾胃虛弱所致孕吐的處方。CAM，第3版，第482頁；CAM，第4版，第585頁"
    },
    {
      "number": 374,
      "question_en": "A 42 year-old male has had perennial allergic rhinitis for eleven years. The symptoms are blocked nose, sneezing in the morning, and runny-watery nasal discharge. The nasal symptoms are worse with cold weather, better with warm weather, and better with spicy foods. He also has nasal polyps. His scalp is often dry with dandruff. His history reveals that he also has eczema around the navel. He also has a red-dry rash around the anus with hemorrhoids. He is often sensitive to cold weather, has back pain, frequent-pale urination, and early morning loose stools. The pulse is weak on the left rear position and the tongue is pale and a little swollen. Which Extraordinary Vessel would you primarily select for treatment?",
      "question_hant": "一名42歲男性患有常年性過敏性鼻炎已11年，症狀為鼻塞、晨起噴嚏、鼻水清稀。鼻部症狀在天冷時加重，天暖時改善，食用辛辣食物後也會改善。他也有鼻息肉。頭皮常乾燥並有頭皮屑。病史顯示他臍周也有濕疹，肛門周圍有乾紅疹並伴有痔瘡。他常怕冷，有腰痛、頻尿且尿色清白、晨起大便稀溏。左尺脈弱，舌淡且略腫。您會優先選用哪一條奇經來治療？",
