    {
      "number": 385,
      "question_en": "A 37 year-old female was diagnosed with fibromyalgia five years ago. She reports a recent attack started two days ago after being caught in a heavy rain while taking a walk. She says that her muscles hurt a lot, that her body feels heavy, and she feels physically lazy and inert. Asked about her menstrual cycle, she says that the blood is dark. One can see that she also has a dark complexion. The tongue has a thick-sticky coating. The pulse is slippery. The point prescription REN-9 (shui fen), SP-9 (yin ling quan), KI-7 (fu liu), LI-10 (shou san li), ST-36 (zu san li), and Ah Shi points. She received daily treatments for five days. On her check up visit, she reports that the worst is over and now has returned to her \"regular\" fibromyalgia symptoms. These symptoms are achy muscles (particularly fixed, boring pain in the upper back area) which are worse in damp weather. She says her limbs feel like a dead-weight and are numb. She is often fatigued. While waiting to fall asleep, she has restless legs and her mind is agitated. During the night her joint and muscle pain worsen to the point of startling her into waking up. The tongue coating is normal. The pulse has become wiry. What new points would you consider adding to the original prescription?",
      "question_hant": "一名37歲女性五年前被診斷為纖維肌痛症。她表示兩天前在散步時遭大雨淋濕後，近日症狀發作。她說肌肉痠痛劇烈，身體感覺沉重，且感到懶怠倦怠。詢問月經週期時，她表示經血顏色暗黑。可觀察到她面色晦暗。舌苔厚膩，脈滑。處方為水分、陰陵泉、復溜、手三里、足三里及阿是穴，連續治療五天。複診時，她表示最嚴重的症狀已過去，目前恢復為她「平常」的纖維肌痛症症狀，包括肌肉痠痛（尤其是上背部固定不移的刺痛），於潮濕天氣加重。她表示四肢感覺沉重如負重物，且有麻木感，常感疲倦。入睡前雙腿不寧，心神躁動不安。夜間關節與肌肉疼痛加劇，甚至會痛醒。舌苔恢復正常，脈轉為弦脈。您會考慮在原處方中加入哪些新穴位？",
