      "number": 415,
      "question_en": "A 47 year-old male has the diagnosis of type 1 diabetes. The western medications and acupuncture treatment have controlled the symptoms. He is receiving regular maintenance acupuncture treatments with the points BL-13 (fei shu), BL-20 (pi shu), BL-23 (shen shu), ST-36 (zu san li) and KI-3 (tai xi) but the patient still complains of strong thirst for cold liquids. Which points would you add to the prescription?",
