      "exp_en": "Treatment tables and chairs used for treatments need to be disinfected between each patient visit.. Clean housekeeping surfaces (e.g., floors, tabletops) on a regular basis (e.g.,daily, or at least three times per week), when spills occur, and when these surfaces are visibly soiled. HBV can survive on room temperature surfaces for at least a week. Disinfectants reduce the risk of infection. They do not kill all pathogens. EPA-registered disinfectants can neutralize most of the common viruses (including HBV). If not in the original container, disinfectants must be labeled (type of solution, when mixed, concentration). Clean Needle Technique, 7th Edition, page 189, 196",
      "exp_hant": "用於治療的治療床與治療椅，需於每位病患就診之間進行消毒。一般環境表面（如地板、桌面）應定期清潔（例如每日一次，或至少每週三次），並於發生潑濺或表面明顯髒污時清潔。B型肝炎病毒（HBV）可在室溫表面存活至少一週。消毒劑能降低感染風險，但無法殺滅所有病原體。經美國環保署（EPA）登記的消毒劑能中和大多數常見病毒（包括HBV）。若消毒劑未存放於原包裝容器中，則必須標示其溶液種類、配製時間及濃度。《Clean Needle Technique》，第7版，第189、196頁"
