      "exp_en": "Lung Yin Deficiency. The treatment principle is to Tonify Lung Yin, Nourish Body Fluids, and, if needed, Clear Empty-Heat. REN-17 (shan zhong) strengthens the qi and yin of the Lungs. The yuan-source point LU-9 (tai yuan) tonifies Lung yin. BL-43 (gao huang shu) strengthens Lung yin and is selected in chronic conditions. BL-13 (fei shu) reinforce Lung qi and yin. KI-6 (zhao hai) tonifies Lung yin and benefits the throat and can be combined with LU-7 (lie que) to open up the Directing vessel to tonify Lung and Kidney yin, descend Lung qi, and regulate the connection between the Kidney and Lung. REN-4 (guan yuan) strengthens Kidney yin when Lung yin xu is connected to Kidney yin xu. Reducing method on LU-10 (yu ji) clears empty fire from the Lungs. Other points that can be added to the formula are DU-12 (zhen zhu) to strengthen Lung qi and yin, REN-12 (zhong wan) to tonify the Stomach so as to promote fluids, and SP-6 (san yin jiao) to nourish the yin, and LU-11 (qu chi) to clear empty fire. All points are reinforced EXCEPT LU-10 (yu ji) which is reduced. No moxa is used. The Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015, page 576; 2005 Edition, page 547; 1989 Edition page 233",
      "exp_hant": "此為肺陰虛。治療原則為滋補肺陰、養液生津，必要時兼清虛熱。膻中能益肺之氣陰。原穴太淵可滋補肺陰。膏肓俞能增強肺陰，多用於慢性病證。肺俞能補益肺氣與肺陰。照海滋補肺陰、利咽喉，可與列缺相配伍以開通任脈，滋補肺腎之陰、肅降肺氣、調節腎肺相交。當肺陰虛累及腎陰時，關元可加強腎陰。魚際以瀉法可清肺中虛火。此方尚可加入身柱以增強肺之氣陰、加中脘以補胃生津、加三陰交以滋陰、加曲池以清虛火。除魚際使用瀉法外，其餘穴位皆用補法。不用灸法。(出處：The Foundations of Chinese Medicine，Maciocia，2015年，第576頁；2005年版，第547頁；1989年版，第233頁)"
    },
