          "hant": "大敦、行間、太衝、曲池、風池、筋縮",
          "correct": false
        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "Parkinson's is an internal Wind disorder that is always related to a Liver disharmony. Liver Wind can be generated from Heat, Liver Yang Rising, Liver Fire, or Liver Blood/Yin deficiency. This patient had Liver Blood Xu (hair loss, night blindness, blurred vision) that generated Wind (tremor, trembling, deviated tongue). LR-3 and GB-20 extinguish Wind. LI-4 subdues Yang and thus extinguishes Wind. TB-5 and DU-19 extinguish Liver Wind. SP-6, ST-36, KI-3, and LR-8 nourish Liver Blood. REN-4 and BL-17 are general blood tonics. That the tremors were resolved and the tongue was no longer deviated indicated that the Wind was tamed. There is one sign (bluish-purple and swollen tongue) and one symptom (arm stiffness) that point to an unresolved disharmony. These point to Blood Stasis (purplish tongue) and Phlegm (swollen tongue) obstructing the sinews (arm rigidity). SP-10 and LR-3 invigorate Blood and move qi stasis. ST-40 and REN-12 transform phlegm. GB-34 is the gathering point for the sinews (tendons and ligaments). The Rx with LI-14 treats the manifestation but not the root (unresolved disharmony). These local arm points could be combined with the root points for a more complete treatment. The Rx with LR-1 is for Parkinson's due to Liver Fire generating Wind. The scalp chorea point is what would be selected to treat tremors. The Practice of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2008, page 1173, 1175, 1047",
      "exp_hant": "帕金森氏症屬於內風病症，向來與肝的失調有關。肝風可由熱、肝陽上亢、肝火，或肝血／肝陰虛所引動。此病人為肝血虛（掉髮、夜盲、視力模糊）進而生風（震顫、顫抖、舌歪斜）。太衝與風池能熄風。合谷能平抑陽氣，因而熄風。外關與後頂能熄肝風。三陰交、足三里、太谿、曲泉能滋養肝血。關元與膈俞則為一般性的補血穴。震顫消失、舌不再歪斜，顯示肝風已被平息。仍有一個徵象（舌質青紫且腫脹）與一個症狀（手臂僵硬）顯示證候尚未完全解決，分別指向瘀血阻絡（舌紫）與痰阻筋脈（舌腫、手臂僵硬）。血海與太衝能活血化瘀、行氣散結。豐隆與中脘能化痰。陽陵泉為筋之會穴。以臂臑為主的處方雖能治標，卻無法治本（未解之證候）。這些局部手臂穴位可與治本穴位合用，以求更完整的療效。以大敦為主的處方適用於肝火生風型的帕金森氏症。至於頭皮舞蹈震顫控制線則是用於治療震顫的選穴。(出處：The Practice of Chinese Medicine，Maciocia，2008年，第1173、1175、1047頁)"
