      "exp_en": "KI-8 is the xi-cleft point of the yin qiao mai (yin stepping vessel). It benefits the uterus and regulate menstruation as a well as resolve lower burner dampness. It can treat uterine bleeding arising from either deficiency or excess. It regulates menstrual disorders arising from Blood stagnation. It also helps treat uterine bleeding due to Deficient Kidneys. One of the actions of the yin qiao mai is to treat abdominal distention, abdominal masses, difficult delivery, or retained placenta arising from stagnation. The yin qiao mai is selected in these conditions only if the symptoms are unilateral. The yin qiao mai can also be selected to treat unilateral adhesions after abdominal surgery. A Manual of Acupuncture, Deadman, 2nd Edition, page 349; The Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015 Edition, page 924, 1068",
      "exp_hant": "交信是陰蹻脈的郄穴，能調補胞宮、調理月經，並化解下焦濕氣。無論虛實所致的崩漏皆可治療，也能調理因血瘀所致的月經失調，並有助於治療腎虛所致的崩漏。陰蹻脈的功能之一，是治療因瘀滯所致的腹脹、腹部腫塊、難產或胎盤滯留。唯有在症狀偏於單側時，才會選用陰蹻脈穴位處理上述病證；陰蹻脈亦可用於治療腹部手術後單側沾黏的情況。(出處：A Manual of Acupuncture，Deadman，第2版，第349頁；The Foundations of Chinese Medicine，Maciocia，2015年版，第924、1068頁)"
