          "en": "Add ST-36 (zu san li) and REN-12 (zhong wan)",
          "hant": "加足三里與中脘",
          "correct": true
        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "The 8-Principles diagnosis is Interior, Cold, Excess. The etiology is Phlegm Retention. The organ pattern is Phlegm Retention in the Stomach Inhibiting Ascension of Clear Yang. The treatment principle is to remove phlegm and regulate the qi. ST-8 is selected to clear the turbid qi in the head to treat dizziness or headache. GB-20 regulates the qi of shao yang to promote the free flow of Liver qi which is helpful in removing Phlegm. ST-25 regulates yang ming channels to relieve abdominal pain and stagnant qi in the middle burner. ST-40 transforms phlegm. ST-36 and REN-12 were added to harmonize the middle burner, regulate the flow of qi, further transform Phlegm, and alleviate epigastric pain. The poor appetite is due to the retention of Phlegm in the middle burner. The epigastric pain is also caused by Phlegm retention. PC-6 is not needed as the nausea has resolved itself. Though there are signs of blood stasis (purple dots on tongue), the blood stasis results from the Phlegm obstructing Blood flow. Transforming the Phlegm will invigorate blood flow and there is no need to directly address the blood stasis with BL-17 and SP-10 as it is a mild sign. Blood pressure is high while pulse and respiration rate are normal. The Dix-Hallpike test determines whether dizziness is triggered by certain movements of the head. This test locates the cause of dizziness as either the inner ear or the brain. If the problem is in the ear, the test helps to determine the affected ear. Acupuncture Patterns and Practice, Eastland Press, 1993, Xuemai and Jingyi, Pages 42-45",
      "exp_hant": "八綱辨證為裡、寒、實證。病因為痰飲內停。臟腑辨證為痰飲停胃、清陽不升。治療原則為化痰理氣。取頭維以清頭部濁氣，治療頭暈或頭痛。風池能調暢少陽之氣，促進肝氣條達，有助於化痰。天樞能調理陽明經氣，緩解腹痛及中焦氣滯。豐隆能化痰。加入足三里與中脘，是為了調和中焦、理氣、進一步化痰，並緩解上腹疼痛。食慾不振是由於痰飲停滯中焦所致，上腹疼痛同樣是痰飲停滯所引起。由於噁心已自行緩解，故不需再用內關。雖然舌上有瘀血徵象（紫點），但此瘀血是痰飲阻滯血行所致，化痰即能促進血行通暢，此徵象輕微，無需再以膈俞及血海直接處理瘀血。血壓偏高，但脈搏與呼吸頻率皆正常。Dix-Hallpike測試可判斷頭暈是否因頭部特定動作所誘發，此測試可用以定位頭暈的成因是內耳或腦部；若病灶在耳部，此測試也有助於判斷是哪一側耳朵受累。(出處：Acupuncture Patterns and Practice，Eastland Press，1993年，Xuemai and Jingyi，第42-45頁)"
    },
