      "question_en": "Which point Harmonizes the upper and lower; Expels wind from taiyang channel; Treats hemorrhoids; and Activates the channel and alleviates pain?",
      "question_hant": "哪個穴位能調和上下、袪除太陽經之風、治療痔瘡，並能通經止痛？",
