      "exp_en": "Bensky describes the location of the Subcortex as the anterior side of the inner wall of the anti-tragus. CAM does not describe a location. CAM also provides the alternate name as the brain point. CAM does give actions and indications. The Subcortex reinforces marrow and replenishes the brain, relieves pain, and eases the mind. It is indicated for insomnia, dream disturbed sleep, tinnitus from Kidney deficiency, and poor mental development (oligophrenia). For Bensky, the Subcortex point regulates excitation and inhibition of the cerebral cortex. It is often used for insomnia, lassitude, and neuropsychiatric disorders. It also treats pain, inflammation, and excess sweating. CAM, 3rd Edition, page 520; CAM 4th Edition, page 426; Bensky, 1981, page 485",
      "exp_hant": "Bensky將皮質下的位置描述為對耳屏內側壁的前側。CAM則未描述其位置，但提供了「腦點」這個別名，並列出其作用與主治。皮質下能益髓補腦、止痛、寧心安神，主治失眠、多夢、腎虛耳鳴，以及智力發育不良（智能不足）。就Bensky而言，皮質下能調節大腦皮質的興奮與抑制，常用於治療失眠、倦怠及神經精神疾患，亦能治療疼痛、發炎與多汗。(出處：CAM，第3版，第520頁；CAM，第4版，第426頁；Bensky，1981年，第485頁)"
