      "exp_en": "SP-1 is a wood point, jing-well point, and a ghost point (name of point means Ghost Fortress). SP-1 is the entry point and SP-21 is the exit point. The jing-well points are where the qi emanates. jing-well points clear heat and restore consciousness (SP-1 treats fainting, collapse, coma, high fever), treat the uppermost reaches of the channel (SP-1 treats fullness of the chest), treat fullness below the Heart (SP-1 treats cold sensation below the heart), and treat disorders of the spirit (SP-1 treats mania, insomnia). As one of the 13 ghost points, SP-1 treats manic-depression and epilepsy. Point Action: SP-1 stops bleeding, regulates the Spleen, unbinds the chest, calms the Heart and spirit, and restores consciousness. A Manual of Acupuncture, Deadman, 2001, page 53, 182",
      "exp_hant": "隱白是木穴、井穴，也是十三鬼穴之一（穴名意為「鬼壘」）。隱白是本經的入穴，大包則為出穴。井穴是經氣所出之處，能清熱、醒神開竅（隱白可治昏厥、虛脫、昏迷、高熱），能治療經脈循行最上端的病症（隱白可治胸中滿悶），能治心下痞滿（隱白可治心下寒感），也能治神志疾患（隱白可治躁狂、失眠）。作為十三鬼穴之一，隱白能治療躁鬱及癲癇。穴位作用：隱白能止血、調理脾氣、寬胸、寧心安神，並能甦厥醒神。(出處：A Manual of Acupuncture，Deadman，2001年，第53、182頁)"
