      "exp_en": "The diagnosis is Bone Bi syndrome with Blood and Yin Deficiency. The treatment principle is to Remove Channel Obstructions. Expel Dampness and Cold, Nourish Blood and Yin. LI-3 and the extra point ba xie expels Cold-Damp from the fingers. TB-5 expels external Wind. ST-36 and SP-6 nourish the Blood. KI-3 and BL-23 tonify the yin. The finger pain is due to an invasion of Wind-Cold (worse with cold). Over time the condition transformed into a chronic Painful Obstruction Syndrome with Phlegm stagnation in the joints (bone deformities). There was an original Blood deficiency (scanty menses, eye floaters, pale tongue) which turned into a deficient yin of the Kidneys (hair loss, weak knees, floating-weak pulse). The Practice of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2008, page 1016 1994 Edition, page 598",
      "exp_hant": "此為骨痺兼血虛陰虧之證。治療原則為疏通經絡、袪風除濕散寒、滋養陰血。三間配合經外奇穴八邪能袪除手指部位的寒濕。外關能袪除外風。足三里與三陰交能滋養陰血。太谿與腎俞能滋補腎陰。手指疼痛乃因風寒侵襲所致（遇冷加重）。隨著時間推移，病證轉化為慢性痺證，痰濁停滯於關節（骨節變形）。原本即有血虛（月經量少、眼前飛蚊、舌淡）之底，久而轉化為腎陰虧虛（掉髮、膝軟無力、脈浮而虛）。(出處：The Practice of Chinese Medicine，Maciocia，2008年，第1016頁；1994年版，第598頁)"
