    {
      "number": 458,
      "question_en": "A 53 year-old male has a history of constipation for the past year. He has infrequent bowel movements about every 3-4 days. He describes the stools as dry and difficult to pass. When asked about his bloodshot eyes, he says that he stayed up late with friends drinking at a local bar after work. He also reports waking up with a pounding headache from the drinking. When asked about his job environment he becomes resentful, complaining how slow his co-workers are at finishing projects. The pulse is wiry. The tongue is slightly red on the sides. He is treated with GB-34 (yanglingquan), REN-6 (qihai), LR-3 (taichong), and TB-6 (zhigou) for four weekly sessions. During evaluation, he reports no improvement in the constipation. His stools are still dry. He does report being less irritable at work but still resentful at his co-workers. Asked about his headaches, he says that he had another after drinking with friends to celebrate finishing a big project. Asked about any new symptoms, he says that he noticed after a night of drinking his urine is darker than usual. His pulse is wiry. No change in the tongue. What treatment would you choose?",
      "question_hant": "一位53歲男性過去一年有便秘病史，排便次數不多，約每3至4天一次，主訴糞便乾燥、排出困難。問及他的雙眼佈滿血絲時，他表示下班後常與朋友到當地酒吧喝酒到深夜，並提到飲酒後醒來會有陣陣頭痛。問及工作環境時，他顯得憤憤不平，抱怨同事完成專案的速度太慢。脈弦，舌邊略紅。他接受了陽陵泉、氣海、太衝、支溝的治療，每週一次，共四次。回診評估時，他表示便秘並無改善，糞便依然乾燥。他表示在工作上較不易動怒，但對同事仍感到不滿。問及頭痛狀況，他說在與朋友慶祝完成一項大專案、飲酒之後又再次頭痛發作。問及是否有新出現的症狀，他提到某次飲酒後隔天發現尿色比平常深。脈仍弦，舌象無變化。此時你會選擇什麼治療？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "en": "SP-15 (daheng), LR-8 (ququan), REN-4 (guanyuan) ST-36 (zusanli), SP-6 (sanyinjiao)",
