          "en": "BL-25 (dachangshu), GB-34 (yanglingquan), REN-6 (qihai), LR-3 (taichong), TB-6 (zhigou)",
          "hant": "大腸俞、陽陵泉、氣海、太衝、支溝",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "en": "LI-4 (hegu), TB-6 (zhigou), LR-2 (xingjian), SP-6 (sanyinjiao), left side ST-28 (shuidao)",
          "hant": "合谷、支溝、行間、三陰交、左側水道",
