      "exp_en": "Ying-spring and Fire point. LU-10 (yuji) clears heat in either the Lung zang or Lung channel. LU-10 (yuji) has a specific affinity for the throat (pain, congestion, dryness, and voice loss) whether due to xu or shi. If heat vaporizes Lung yin fluids, there will be sweating. If heat consumes the Lung yin fluids there will be coughing and no sweating. LU-10 (yuji) is effective in clearing heat in the Lungs whether from excess or yin xu. LU-10 (yuji) can be used when there is Lung heat that causes coughing blood (upper jiao), vomiting blood (middle jiao), and blood in the urine (lower jiao via the transmission of heat from the Lung to the Heart-Small Intestine-Bladder). LU-10 (yuji) is indicated when there is a disorder in the relationship between the Lung, Heart, and Stomach (if Lung heat is transmitted to the Heart there can be agitation, anger, mania. If the Lung qi is deficient it can lead to the Heart unable to circulate Heart blood leading to SOB and chest pain. If Lung heat is transmitted to the Stomach channel there can be tooth pain, breast abscess, tearing, cough, hiccup). A Manual of Acupuncture, Deadman, 2nd Edition, page 88",
      "exp_hant": "此為滎穴、屬火。魚際能清瀉肺臟或肺經之熱，對咽喉部位（疼痛、堵塞感、乾燥、失聲）特別有療效，無論屬虛屬實皆可應用。若熱邪蒸騰肺陰津液，則會出汗；若熱邪耗傷肺陰津液，則會咳嗽而無汗。無論是實熱或陰虛內熱，魚際皆能有效清瀉肺熱。當肺熱導致咳血（上焦）、吐血（中焦），或因熱由肺傳心、小腸、膀胱而致尿血（下焦）時，皆可使用魚際。魚際亦適用於肺、心、胃三者關係失調之證（若肺熱傳心，可見煩躁、易怒、躁狂；若肺氣虛弱，可致心無力運行心血，出現氣短、胸痛；若肺熱傳於胃經，則可見牙痛、乳癰、流淚、咳嗽、呃逆）。(出處：A Manual of Acupuncture，Deadman，第2版，第88頁)"
