      "question_en": "The Triple Burner luo-connecting channel begins at TB-5 (wai guan) and converges with the Pericardium channel at the",
      "question_hant": "三焦經之絡脈始於 TB-5 (wai guan) 外關，並與心包經匯合於何處？",
