    {
      "number": 566,
      "question_en": "The points KI-13 (qi xue) and KI-14 (si man) on the Penetrating Vessel (chong mai) have the indication of treating",
      "question_hant": "衝脈上的腎經13（氣穴）與腎經14（四滿）兩穴，其主治適應症為？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "en": "heavy legs",
          "hant": "兩腿沉重",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "en": "chest and heart pain",
          "hant": "胸痛與心痛",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "en": "prolapsed uterus",
          "hant": "子宮脫垂",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "en": "running piglet qi",
          "hant": "奔豚氣",
          "correct": true
        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "Some texts outline the chong mai as terminating at the lips while other texts show that the chong mai terminates at the inner part of the eye. This explains this recurrent symptom in the indications for all of the Kidney points on the chong mai. Generally, many of the Kidney points on the chong mai treat genital pain and lower abdominal pain, move blood stasis (chong mai is Sea of Blood) in menstrual disorders (regulate the Uterus), and treat qi stagnation in the abdomen (chong mai is Sea of the Avenues of the Abdomen). KI-13 (qi xue) and KI-14 (si man) have running piglet qi in their indications. KI-11 (heng gu) has uterine prolapse and rectum prolapse in its indications. KI-20 (fu tong gu) and KI-21 (you men) have indications that relate to the Upper Burner or chest area (heart pain, palpitations, chest fullness, cough, SOB). A Manual of Acupuncture, Deadman, 2nd Edition, page 351-359",
      "exp_hant": "正確答案為奔豚氣。部分典籍記載衝脈終止於口唇，另有典籍記載衝脈終止於目內眥，這解釋了衝脈上腎經諸穴主治中反覆出現此類症狀的原因。整體而言，衝脈上多數腎經穴位可治療生殖器疼痛與小腹疼痛，衝脈為血海，能活血化瘀以調理月經失調（調理子宮），衝脈亦為腹部諸經之海，能治療腹部氣滯。KI-13 (qi xue) 氣穴與KI-14 (si man) 四滿的主治中皆列有奔豚氣。KI-11 (heng gu) 橫骨的主治中列有子宮脫垂與脫肛。KI-20 (fu tong gu) 腹通谷與KI-21 (you men) 幽門的主治則與上焦或胸部相關（心痛、心悸、胸悶、咳嗽、氣短）。參考資料：《A Manual of Acupuncture》，Deadman 第2版，第351-359頁。"
    },
