      "exp_en": "The Kidney main channel meets with four ren mai points. After entering the body at DU-1 (chang qiang), ascending the spine, connecting with the Kidney and Bladder, the channel emerges in the lower abdomen and connects to the ren mai at REN-3 (zhong ji), REN-4 (guan yuan), and REN-7 (yin jiao). An internal branch ascends from the Kidney organ, through the Liver, and enters the Lung. Then from the Lung one branch joins the Heart and links up with the Pericardium channel at REN-17 (shan zhong). Besides the ren mai meeting points, the Kidney main channel also has two other meeting points: SP-6 (san yin jiao) and DU-1 (chang qiang). A Manual of Acupuncture, Deadman, 2nd Edition, page 331",
      "exp_hant": "正確答案為 REN-3 (zhong ji) 中極、REN-4 (guan yuan) 關元、REN-7 (yin jiao) 陰交、REN-17 (shan zhong) 膻中。腎經正經與任脈共有四個交會穴。腎經自DU-1 (chang qiang) 長強入內，沿脊柱上行，聯絡腎與膀胱後，出於小腹，於REN-3 (zhong ji) 中極、REN-4 (guan yuan) 關元及REN-7 (yin jiao) 陰交與任脈交會。其內行支自腎臟上行，貫肝，入肺；再由肺分支入心，於REN-17 (shan zhong) 膻中與心包經相連。除任脈交會穴外，腎經正經還有另外兩個交會穴：SP-6 (san yin jiao) 三陰交與DU-1 (chang qiang) 長強。參考資料：《A Manual of Acupuncture》，Deadman 第2版，第331頁。"
    },
