    {
      "number": 632,
      "question_en": "Does the patient's employer have the right to the patient's chart in a worker's compensation claim?",
      "question_hant": "在工傷賠償申請案中，病人的雇主是否有權取得病人的病歷？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
