      ],
      "exp_en": "The specifics of what can be released varies from state to state. Throughout the worker compensation process, many claimants may receive notices from the employer or insurer that request copies of their medical records or to complete a release form, which allows the employer or insurer to request the medical records on their own. The employer or insurer sees this as a way to ensure that the claimant is receiving the necessary treatment and to ensure that claimants are not \"abusing\" the privilege of receiving free medical treatment.",
      "exp_hant": "可揭露的具體內容依各州規定而異。在工傷賠償的整個過程中，許多申請人可能會收到雇主或保險公司的通知，要求提供病歷副本，或要求填寫一份授權書，讓雇主或保險公司得以自行調閱病歷。雇主或保險公司將此視為一種方式，用以確保申請人正在接受必要的治療，並確保申請人並未「濫用」免費醫療的權益。"
