      "exp_en": "Frequency is the number of pulses per second. The low frequency stimulation of 1-10 pulses/second mainly affects motor neurons. Low frequencies also disperse edema and acute stagnation. High frequencies of 80-100 pulse/second mainly affects sensory nerve fibers. Sensory nerve fibers are associated with temperature, pressure, and touch. Electro-acupuncture frequencies of 80-100 pulse/second are effective in treating neuropathies that have a sensory deficit such as degenerative disc diseases. Sports Medicine Acupuncture, AcuSports Education, Callison, page 166",
      "exp_hant": "頻率是指每秒脈衝的次數。每秒1至10次脈衝的低頻刺激主要影響運動神經元，低頻也有助於消散水腫與急性氣血鬱滯。每秒80至100次脈衝的高頻刺激則主要影響感覺神經纖維，感覺神經纖維與溫度、壓力及觸覺有關。每秒80至100次脈衝的電針頻率，對於伴有感覺缺損的神經病變（如椎間盤退化性疾病）具有良好療效。Sports Medicine Acupuncture，AcuSports Education出版，Callison著，第166頁"
