      "exp_en": "This is the Chorea and Tremor Area which is the primary area used to treat Parkinson's disease, tremors of all types, as well as involuntary shaking of the head, body or extremities. It is used to treat neurological disorders such as Syndenham's chorea, tremors, palsy. It is used to treat tics, restless leg syndrome, and dystonia. The Chorea and Tremor Area is effective in the treatment of patients with muscle tension and tightness in any part of the body, usually directing the needling from the upper part of the area downward to penetrate the entire area 4 cm. This area is always needled bilaterally and is selected for any involuntary motor activity. Hao, Jason Jishun and Hao, Linda Lingzhi. (2016). Chinese Scalp Acupuncture. Blue Poppy Press. p. 51. Bensky, Dan. (1981). Acupuncture; A Comprehensive Text. Eastland Press. p. 500.",
      "exp_hant": "此為舞蹈震顫區，是治療帕金森氏病、各種震顫，以及頭部、軀幹或肢體不自主抖動的主要區域，也用於治療西德納姆氏舞蹈病（Syndenham's chorea）、震顫、癱瘓等神經系統疾病，並可治療抽動、不寧腿症候群與肌張力不全。舞蹈震顫區對於身體任何部位出現肌肉緊繃僵硬的病人皆有療效，通常由該區上端向下透刺，貫穿整個4公分的區域。此區域一律採雙側針刺，適用於任何不自主運動。郝吉順（Jason Jishun Hao）、郝令芝（Linda Lingzhi Hao）著（2016年）。《中國頭皮針》。Blue Poppy Press出版，第51頁。Dan Bensky著（1981年）。《針灸學大成》（Acupuncture; A Comprehensive Text）。Eastland Press出版，第500頁。"
