    {
      "number": 664,
      "question_en": "What is an alpha motor neuron inhibition?",
      "question_hant": "什麼是α運動神經元抑制？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "en": "a dysfunction of the nerve impulse of both the muscle spindles and Golgi tendon organs",
          "hant": "肌梭與高爾基腱器官兩者神經衝動同時發生功能障礙",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "en": "a dysfunction in the nerve impulse that contracts the muscle",
          "hant": "使肌肉收縮的神經衝動發生功能障礙",
          "correct": true
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "en": "a dysfunction of the nerve impulse to muscle spindles",
          "hant": "傳導至肌梭的神經衝動發生功能障礙",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "en": "a dysfunction of the nerve impulse to Golgi tendon organs",
          "hant": "傳導至高爾基腱器官的神經衝動發生功能障礙",
          "correct": false
        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "Motor points treat skeletal motor neuron inhibitions. Alpha motor neurons innervate the muscle fibers to produce the contraction that moves a joint. Motor muscle inhibition (alpha motor neuron muscle inhibition) is when the nerve that sends the impulse to contract the muscle becomes unable to function at its optimal capacity. This can be caused by chemical or physical trauma. Direct or repetitive trauma or joint changes due to inflammation, swelling, or arthritis can impair the motor nerve impulse. Any trauma, pain, or neurogenic inflammation in the region of the joint or muscle belly can trigger a change of afferent nerve impulses to the muscle, causing motor inhibition or a weakening of the muscle. An alpha motor neuron inhibition will indirectly affect the nerve impulses to the muscle spindles and to the Golgi tendon organs. Skeletal muscle can become neurally inhibited or facilitated. Inhibition means that neural connection is absent, bypassed, incomplete, weak, or overridden. The result is a weak muscle. Facilitation means that neural connection is strong, overactive, or hyperactive. The result is a tight and short muscle. Motor points help to regulate dysfunctional neuromuscular connections so that reciprocal inhibition is normalized. Motor Point Acupuncture Foundation, Chinese Medicine Education, Hazel, Online Seminar",
      "exp_hant": "運動點可治療骨骼肌運動神經元的抑制狀態。α運動神經元支配肌纖維，產生使關節活動的收縮。運動肌肉抑制（α運動神經元肌肉抑制）是指負責傳送收縮訊號的神經，無法以最佳效能運作，可能由化學性或物理性創傷所引起。關節部位因發炎、腫脹或關節炎所導致的直接或反覆性創傷或改變，皆可能損害運動神經衝動。關節或肌腹區域的任何創傷、疼痛或神經性發炎，都可能引發傳向肌肉的傳入神經衝動發生改變，造成運動抑制或肌肉無力。α運動神經元抑制也會間接影響傳向肌梭與高爾基腱器官的神經衝動。骨骼肌可能出現神經抑制或神經促進：抑制是指神經連結缺失、被繞過、不完整、微弱或遭到覆蓋，結果導致肌肉無力；促進則是指神經連結強烈、過度活躍或亢進，結果導致肌肉緊繃縮短。運動點有助於調節功能失調的神經肌肉連結，使交互抑制恢復正常。Motor Point Acupuncture Foundation，Chinese Medicine Education，Hazel著，線上研討課程"
    },
