      "exp_en": "PC-5 is an important point in resolving phlegm in the upper burner, especially the Heart. When phlegm or phlegm-fire obstructs the Heart there can be agitation, depression, mania, plumstone qi, drooling after a stroke, or epilepsy. PC-5 and ST-40 are two of the main points to treat Phlegm disorders. Phlegm obstructing the Heart can arise from 1) an excess of emotions stagnating the qi leading to unsmooth flow of body fluids generating Phlegm. 2) Liver qi stasis impairing the Spleen function of transformation and transportation which then generates dampness clumping into Phlegm. 3) high fever evaporating the body fluids which then condense into Phlegm. PC-5 has a Blood invigorating action on menstruation. This is due to the connection of the Pericardium to the Liver in jue yin (terminal yin). PC-5 can treat irregular menstruation, dysmenorrhea, and clotted menstrual flow. PC-5 is the jing-river point and the Metal point. The action of PC-5 are to transform Phlegm, settle the Mind, descend rebellious qi and regulate the Stomach, and regulate menstruation. A Manual of Acupuncture, Deadman, 2nd Edition, page 374; The Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015 Edition, page 1081",
      "exp_hant": "間使是化解上焦（尤其是心）痰濁的重要穴位。當痰或痰火矇蔽心竅時，可出現躁動不安、憂鬱、躁狂、梅核氣、中風後流涎，或癲癇。間使與豐隆是治療痰證的兩個主要穴位。痰阻心竅可能源自：1）情志過極導致氣機鬱滯，使津液運行不暢而生痰；2）肝氣鬱滯影響脾之運化功能，因而聚濕成痰；3）高熱蒸灼津液，凝聚成痰。間使對月經具有活血作用，這是因為心包經在厥陰經與肝經相連之故，間使可治療月經不調、痛經與經血夾塊。間使為經穴（金穴），其作用為化痰、寧心、降逆和胃，並調理月經。A Manual of Acupuncture，Deadman著，第2版，第374頁；The Foundations of Chinese Medicine，Maciocia著，2015年版，第1081頁"
