      "exp_en": "The original presentation is manifesting as Lung Heat. It is the qi level in the Four Level diagnosis. LU-5, a water and he-sea point, clears Lung Heat and descends Lung qi. LU-5 clears all types of heat (xu or shi) from the Lungs. LU-10, a fire and ying-spring point, also clears Lung Heat and descends Lung qi. As a ying-spring point it is indicated for heat in the body. BL-13, a back-shu point, can be selected to treat both deficiency and excess patterns in the Lungs. In this case, BL-13 is selected to clear Lung Heat and descends Lung qi. As the meeting point for the six yang channels, DU-14 has a strong action on clearing yang heat from the body. As the patient was exposed to hot-humid weather, the pattern of Lung Heat has changed to a Damp-Heat invading Spleen pattern. Both patterns are at the qi level. SP-6 and SP-9 resolve lower jiao dampness and heat. REN-9 resolves dampness by stimulating the transformation and transportation of fluids. BL-20 strengthens the Spleen function in relation to water regulation. LI-11 is a point that clears heat. Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015, page 773, 775; 2005 Edition, page 729, 730",
      "exp_hant": "最初的表現屬肺熱證，在衛氣營血辨證中屬氣分。尺澤為水穴、合穴，能清肺熱、降肺氣，可清除肺中虛實各類熱邪；魚際為火穴、滎穴，同樣能清肺熱、降肺氣，作為滎穴，主治身熱。肺俞為背俞穴，可用於治療肺之虛證與實證，此處選用肺俞以清肺熱、降肺氣。大椎為六陽經之交會穴，具有強力清瀉全身陽熱的作用。由於病人曾暴露於悶熱潮濕的環境，肺熱證已轉化為濕熱犯脾證，兩者皆屬氣分。三陰交與陰陵泉可袪除下焦濕熱；水分透過促進津液的運化以化濕；脾俞則加強脾臟在水液調節方面的功能；曲池為清熱要穴。Foundations of Chinese Medicine，Maciocia著，2015年，第773、775頁；2005年版，第729、730頁"
