      "question_en": "A 39 year-old female is suffering from manic-depression. She alternates between periods of deep depression and periods of compulsive shopping and incessant talking. She has the sensation of a plum stuck in her throat. She often drools. She has irregular menstruation with painful and clotted periods. Which Pericardium point would you add to your prescription?",
