      "exp_en": "REN-13 is on the midline of the abdomen, 5 cun above the navel, and 3 cun below the sternocostal angle. KI-20 is on the upper abdomen, 5 cun above the navel, and 0.5 cun lateral to the midline (REN-13). ST-20 is on the abdomen, 2 cun lateral to the midline, 5 cun above the navel, and level with REN-13. REN-13 is the meeting point of Ren Mai with the Stomach and Small Intestine channels. REN-13 harmonizes the Stomach, descends rebellious qi and alleviates vomiting, and regulates the Heart. Deep needling in thin patients can penetrate the peritoneal activity. KI-20 is the meeting point of the Chong Mai and Kidney channels. KI-20 harmonizes the middle burner and unbinds the chest and transforms phlegm. Deep needling can penetrate the peritoneal cavity. ST-20 harmonizes the middle burner and descends rebellion of the Lung and Stomach. In thin patients deep needling can penetrate the peritoneal cavity. Deep needling of the right ST-20 can penetrate an enlarged liver. A Manual of Acupuncture, Deadman, 2nd Edition, pages 513, 144, 358",
      "exp_hant": "REN-13 (shang wan) 上脘 位於腹正中線上，臍上5寸，胸肋角下3寸。KI-20 (tong gu) 通谷 位於上腹部，臍上5寸，旁開正中線（REN-13）0.5寸。ST-20 (cheng man) 承滿 位於腹部，旁開正中線2寸，臍上5寸，與REN-13同高。REN-13 (shang wan) 上脘 為任脈與胃經、小腸經的交會穴，能和胃降逆、止嘔，並調理心神。體型瘦弱者深刺可能穿透腹膜腔。KI-20 (tong gu) 通谷 為衝脈與腎經之交會穴，能和中焦、寬胸化痰，深刺亦可能穿透腹膜腔。ST-20 (cheng man) 承滿 能和中焦、降肺胃之逆氣，瘦弱者深刺可能穿透腹膜腔，若深刺右側ST-20則可能穿及腫大之肝臟。參考資料：《A Manual of Acupuncture》，Deadman，第2版，第513、144、358頁。"
    },
