      "exp_en": "REN-4 is on the midline of the lower abdomen, 3 cun below the navel, and 2 cun above the pubic symphysis. KI-13 is on the lower abdomen, 3 cun below the navel, 2 cun above the superior border of the pubic symphysis, and 0.5 cun lateral to the midline (REN-4). ST-28 is on the lower abdomen, 2 cun lateral to he midline, 3 cun below the navel, and level with REN-4. REN-4 is the front-mu point for the Small Intestine and the meeting point of the Ren Mai with the Spleen, Liver, and Kidney channels. REN-4 strengthens original qi and benefits essence, tonifies the Kidneys, warms and tonifies the Spleen, benefits the uterus and assists conception, regulates the lower burner and benefits the Bladder, regulates Small Intestine qi, and restores collapse. Deep insertion can penetrate a full bladder. KI-13 is the meeting point of the Kidney channel with the Chong Mai. KI-13 regulates the Ren Mai and Chong Mai and regulates the lower jiao. Deep needling will penetrate a full bladder. ST-28 regulates the lower jiao and dispels stagnation, benefits the bladder and the uterus. Deep needling in thin patients can penetrate the peritoneal cavity or can penetrate a full bladder. A Manual of Acupuncture, Deadman, 2nd Edition, page 501, 353, 150",
      "exp_hant": "REN-4 (guan yuan) 關元 位於下腹部正中線上，臍下3寸，恥骨聯合上2寸。KI-13 (qi xue) 氣穴 位於下腹部，臍下3寸，恥骨聯合上緣上2寸，旁開正中線（REN-4）0.5寸。ST-28 (shui dao) 水道 位於下腹部，旁開正中線2寸，臍下3寸，與REN-4同高。REN-4 (guan yuan) 關元 為小腸之募穴，亦為任脈與脾、肝、腎經之交會穴。REN-4 (guan yuan) 關元 能強壯元氣、益精，補腎、溫補脾陽，益胞宮以助孕，調理下焦、利膀胱，調理小腸之氣，並可回陽固脫。深刺可能穿透充盈之膀胱。KI-13 (qi xue) 氣穴 為腎經與衝脈之交會穴，能調理任脈、衝脈及下焦，深刺會穿透充盈之膀胱。ST-28 (shui dao) 水道 能調理下焦、袪瘀，並利膀胱、調子宮，瘦弱者深刺可能穿透腹膜腔或充盈之膀胱。參考資料：《A Manual of Acupuncture》，Deadman，第2版，第501、353、150頁。"
