      "exp_en": "The Stomach luo-connecting channel starts at ST-40 on the lateral side of the lower limb to join with the Spleen channel, ascends the leg and trunk to front of the neck. From there one branch goes to the nape of the neck and an internal branch goes to the throat. At the neck the channel converges with the qi of the other yang channels. The point actions of ST-40 are to transform phlegm-dampness, benefit the chest, clear Lung phlegm, clear Heart phlegm, calm the spirit, and activate the channel and alleviate pain. Luo points treat disorders of their interior-exterior related channel or zang fu. ST-40 transforms phlegm arising when the related Spleen organ fails in transporting and transforming fluids.Luo points treat disorders in areas reached by the luo-connecting channel. ST-40 treats leg atrophy, swelling and pain in the throat, sudden loss of voice, and plumstone throat. Luo points treat psychological and emotional disorders. ST-40 treats manic-depression, mad laughter, desire to ascend to high places, undress and run around, and seeing ghosts. Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015, page 798 2005 Edition, page 760; A Manual of Acupuncture, Deadman, 2nd Edition, page 40, 126, 165; Channels of Acupuncture, Maciocia, 2006, page 250, 258",
      "exp_hant": "胃經之絡脈始於 ST-40 (feng long) 豐隆，位於下肢外側，與脾經相接，向上循行於腿部及軀幹至頸前。其中一支別走至項後，另一內行支則至咽喉。於頸部處，此絡脈與其他陽經之氣相會合。ST-40 (feng long) 豐隆 之穴位作用為化痰濕、寬胸、清肺化痰、清心化痰、安神，並通經止痛。絡穴能治療其相表裡經絡或臟腑之病症，ST-40 (feng long) 豐隆 能化解因脾臟運化輸布水液功能失常所生之痰濁。絡穴亦能治療絡脈循行所及部位之病症，ST-40 (feng long) 豐隆 可治療下肢痿弱、咽喉腫痛、暴瘖及梅核氣。絡穴還能治療情志病症，ST-40 (feng long) 豐隆 可治療躁狂抑鬱、狂笑、欲登高而歌、棄衣而走，以及見鬼等症狀。參考資料：《Foundations of Chinese Medicine》，Maciocia，2015年版，第798頁；2005年版，第760頁；《A Manual of Acupuncture》，Deadman，第2版，第40、126、165頁；《Channels of Acupuncture》，Maciocia，2006年，第250、258頁。"
    },
