      "exp_en": "Both the yin and yang channel ying-spring points clear heat from their respective zang fu and, like jing-well points, from the upper end of the channel. PC-8 is a strong point that clears heat from the Ying and Blood levels and from the Pericardium organ in febrile patterns. This point also cools Heart Fire in the upper jiao and drains Stomach Heat. KI-2 clears Empty Heat from the Kidneys. When the Empty Heat from the Kidney rises you get upper jiao symptoms (throat pain, coughing blood, thirsting disorder) and the Empty Heat blazes down you get lower jiao symptoms (itchy genitals, irregular menstruation, difficult urination). SP-2 clears Spleen and Stomach Damp-Heat. LR-2 clears Liver Fire anywhere in the body such as blazing upward to the head, disturbing the Heart and Spirit, invading the Lungs or Stomach, or entering the Blood (reckless bleeding). LU-10 clears heat in the throat and Lung Heat. LI-2 and ST-44 clear heat in the upper part of their channels (face and head). ST-44 also clears Damp-Heat in the intestines. HT-8 clears Heart Fire which can be transmitted to the Bladder via the Small Intestine. GB-43 clears heat and stagnant qi transforming into heat in the head, eyes, face, and breast. A Manual of Acupuncture, Deadman, 2001, page 33",
      "exp_hant": "無論陰經或陽經之滎穴，皆能清其所屬臟腑之熱，並與井穴相似，能清經絡上部之熱。PC-8 (lao gong) 勞宮 為清營血分及心包熱之要穴，適用於熱病；本穴亦能清上焦心火，並清胃熱。KI-2 (ran gu) 然谷 能清腎之虛熱。腎之虛熱上炎則見上焦症狀（咽痛、咳血、消渴），虛熱下迫則見下焦症狀（外陰搔癢、月經不調、排尿困難）。SP-2 (da du) 大都 能清脾胃濕熱。LR-2 (xing jian) 行間 能清肝火，無論肝火上炎頭部、擾動心神、犯肺犯胃，或入血分（迫血妄行）皆可使用。LU-10 (yu ji) 魚際 能清咽喉熱及肺熱。LI-2 (er jian) 二間 與 ST-44 (nei ting) 內庭 能清其經絡上部（面部、頭部）之熱，ST-44 (nei ting) 內庭 亦能清腸中濕熱。HT-8 (shao fu) 少府 能清心火，此火可經由小腸傳至膀胱。GB-43 (xia xi) 俠谿 能清頭、目、面、乳房部位化熱之氣滯與熱邪。參考資料：《A Manual of Acupuncture》，Deadman，2001年版，第33頁。"
