      "exp_en": "Jing-well points treat the uppermost reaches of the channels. There are eight jing-well points that treat the throat. LU-11 treats acute sore throat, painful throat, and mumps. LI-1, TB-1, ST-45, KI-1, SI-1, GB-44, and HT-9 all treat painful throat obstruction. A Manual of Acupuncture, Deadman, 2nd Edition, page 32",
      "exp_hant": "井穴能治療經絡末端（上部）的病症。共有八個井穴可治療咽喉疾患。LU-11 (shaoshang) 少商 治急性咽喉腫痛、咽喉疼痛、腮腺炎。LI-1、TB-1、ST-45、KI-1、SI-1、GB-44 與 HT-9 皆能治療咽喉腫痛阻塞。參考資料：《A Manual of Acupuncture》，Deadman，第2版，第32頁。"
