          "hant": "陽池",
          "correct": false
        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "The point energetics for LI-4 that it regulates the defensive qi and adjusts sweating, expels wind and releases the exterior, regulates the face, eyes, nose, mouth and ears, activates the channel and alleviates pain, induces labor, and restores the yang. As the Large Intestine channel is related to the Lung channel, LI-4 (hegu) is a main point for expelling wind-cold or wind-heat from the exterior. As LI-4 (hegu) adjusts the pores, it can both promote and stops sweating (reinforce LI-4 (hegu) and reduce KI-7 (fuliu) to promote sweating and reduce LI-4 (hegu) and reinforce KI-7 (fuliu) to stop sweating). When especially combined with LI-11 (quchi), the point LI-4 (hegu) can help reduce high fever regardless of etiology. LI-4 (hegu) is an important point in the treatment of the face and senses (head, face, ears, eyes, nose, cheeks, mouth, teeth) whether acute or chronic, excess or deficient, hot or cold. LI-4 (hegu) is used to treat headaches in any location when they are due to an exterior attack, especially frontal headaches. Clinically, however, it is widely used for headaches such as one-sided (the internal LI channel meets with the GB channel) and generalized headaches. LI-4 (hegu) combined with LR-3 (taichong) is known as the Four Gates which treats painful obstructions, pain, spasms, and to ensure the free and smooth passage of qi and blood throughout the body. LI-4 (hegu) can also be used with collapse of yang (unconsciousness, aversion to cold, purple lips, etc.). LI-4 can be used to regulate the descending of yin to raise the qi when it is sinking and to regulate the ascending of yang such as reversing rebellious qi in the Stomach, Lung, or Liver. A Manual of Acupuncture, Deadman, 2nd Edition, page 103; Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015, page 964",
      "exp_hant": "LI-4 (hegu) 合谷 的穴位作用包括調理衛氣、調節汗出、疏風解表、調理面部與眼、鼻、口、耳，通經止痛、催產，並回陽固脫。由於大腸經與肺經相表裡，LI-4 (hegu) 合谷 是袪除外感風寒或風熱的要穴。由於 LI-4 (hegu) 合谷 能調節腠理，故既能發汗亦能止汗（補 LI-4 (hegu) 合谷、瀉 KI-7 (fuliu) 復溜 以發汗；瀉 LI-4 (hegu) 合谷、補 KI-7 (fuliu) 復溜 以止汗）。若與 LI-11 (quchi) 曲池 合用，LI-4 (hegu) 合谷 有助於退高熱，不論病因為何。LI-4 (hegu) 合谷 是治療面部及五官（頭、面、耳、目、鼻、頰、口、齒）疾患的重要穴位，無論急慢性、虛實、寒熱皆可應用。LI-4 (hegu) 合谷 可治療因外感所致的各部位頭痛，尤其是前額頭痛。臨床上，本穴也廣泛用於偏頭痛（大腸經內行支與膽經相會）及全頭痛。LI-4 (hegu) 合谷 配合 LR-3 (taichong) 太衝 稱為「四關」，能治療痺痛、疼痛、痙攣，並確保全身氣血暢通無阻。LI-4 (hegu) 合谷 亦可用於陽氣虛脫（神昏、畏寒、唇紫等）。LI-4 可用於調節陰氣下降以升提下陷之氣，並調節陽氣上升，如逆轉胃、肺或肝之上逆之氣。參考資料：《A Manual of Acupuncture》，Deadman，第2版，第103頁；《Foundations of Chinese Medicine》，Maciocia，2015年版，第964頁。"
    },
