      ],
      "exp_en": "The primary or main meridians are associated with the circulation of ying qi, not the luo-connecting meridians. The progression of external pathogens (wind, cold, damp, heat, summer heat) proceeds from the superficial luo, minute luo, regular luo, and then to the primary meridians. External pathogens (wind, cold, damp, heat, summer heat) first invade the wei qi level which is the location for the superficial, minute luo, and regular luo meridians. The invasion into the wei qi level is accompanied by exterior wind symptoms (aversion to cold and fever). When wind is associated with other external pathogens there can be additional exterior symptoms corresponding to the associated pathogen. The luo connecting points that can be selected are LU-7 and TB-5 for wind and cold invasion in the wei qi level or TB-5, ST-40, and SP-4 for dampness invasion in the wei qi level. The luo meridian can be invaded by external pathogens without there being exterior symptoms. This occurs when wind invades the facial luo meridians resulting in facial paralysis or numbness without the presence of aversion to cold and fever (exterior symptoms). The main luo points to select here are LU-7 and TB-5. External pathogenic cold can invade the luo meridians of the Stomach, Intestines, or Uterus without exterior symptoms. This cold invasion can cause acute epigastric pain (Stomach), acute abdominal pain and diarrhea (Intestines), and acute menstrual pain (Uterus). When the Stomach is affected the luo point ST-40 can be selected. When the Intestines are affected the luo point SP-4 can be selected. When the Uterus is affected the luo points SP-4, LR-5, and KI-4 can be selected. Meridians of Acupuncture, Maciocia, 2006, page 265-266",
      "exp_hant": "營氣的運行與正經（主要經脈）相關，而非絡脈。外邪（風、寒、濕、熱、暑）的傳變順序是由孫絡、浮絡，再到經絡（絡脈），最後才到正經。外邪（風、寒、濕、熱、暑）首先侵犯衛氣層，而衛氣層正是孫絡、浮絡與絡脈所在之處。邪入衛氣層時會伴隨表風症狀（惡寒發熱）。若風邪與其他外邪相合，則可出現與該外邪相應的其他表證。此時可選用的絡穴，衛分風寒證可取LU-7與TB-5，衛分濕邪證可取TB-5、ST-40與SP-4。然而，絡脈亦可在無表證的情況下被外邪侵犯，例如風邪侵犯面部絡脈導致面癱或面部麻木，而不伴有惡寒發熱等表證，此時主要選用的絡穴為LU-7與TB-5。外寒亦可在無表證的情況下侵犯胃、腸或胞宮之絡脈，造成急性胃脘痛（胃）、急性腹痛腹瀉（腸）以及急性痛經（胞宮）。胃受邪時可選絡穴ST-40，腸受邪時可選絡穴SP-4，胞宮受邪時可選絡穴SP-4、LR-5與KI-4。Meridians of Acupuncture，Maciocia著，2006年版，第265-266頁"
    },
