      "exp_en": "The Small Intestine and Triple Burner muscle channels both go to the head but they stay on one side. The Large Intestine muscle channel goes to the front of the ear, goes up across the top of the head, and terminates at the mandible at the opposite side, like a set of headphones. This is an added explanation as to why LI-4 can treat headaches. Both the Triple Burner and Small Intestine muscle channels go to the outer canthus. The yang muscle channels of the arm start at their respective fingers similar to the primary channels and follow a similar path. The Small Intestine muscle channel follows the posterior aspect of the arm, surrounds the scapula, then enters the ear, binds the mastoid process, binds the mandible, binds the outer canthus and corner of the head. The Triple Burner muscle channel follows the posterior aspect of the arm, binds at the elbow tip, goes to the neck, links with the root of the tongue, branches to the outer canthus, and binds to the corner of the head. The Large Intestine muscle channel follows the lateral aspect of the arm, travels from the shoulder and attaches to the upper thoracic spine, and from the shoulder ascends to the neck, across the cheeks, binds at the side of the nose, crosses over the top of the head to connect with the opposite mandible. The Small Intestine muscle channel connects with the Bladder, Large Intestine, Triple Burner, and Stomach muscle channels. The Large Intestine muscle channel connects with the Small Intestine, Bladder, and Stomach channels. The Triple Burner muscle channel connects with the Small Intestine muscle channel. A Manual of Acupuncture, Deadman, 2nd Edition, page 98, 229, 389; The Channels of Acupuncture, Maciocia, 2006, page 303, 306",
      "exp_hant": "小腸經筋與三焦經筋雖然都會上達頭部，但都僅停留在同一側。大腸經筋則行至耳前，向上橫越頭頂，終止於對側下頜，就像一副耳機一樣。這也補充說明了為何LI-4能治療頭痛。三焦經筋與小腸經筋皆到達外眼角。上肢三條陽經筋皆起於相應手指，路徑與正經相似：小腸經筋沿上肢後側而行，繞過肩胛，進入耳中，結於乳突，結於下頜，並結於外眼角及頭角；三焦經筋沿上肢後側而行，結於肘尖，上行至頸部，聯繫舌根，分支至外眼角，並結於頭角；大腸經筋沿上肢外側而行，從肩部走行並附著於上胸椎，再從肩部上行至頸部，橫越面頰，結於鼻旁，越過頭頂與對側下頜相連。小腸經筋聯繫膀胱、大腸、三焦與胃經筋；大腸經筋聯繫小腸、膀胱與胃經筋；三焦經筋聯繫小腸經筋。A Manual of Acupuncture，Deadman著，第2版，第98、229、389頁；The Channels of Acupuncture，Maciocia著，2006年版，第303、306頁"
