      "exp_en": "The clinical picture points to the use of the Directing Vessel as it treats the Lungs, nourishes yin, can treat digestive problems, and is a strong vessel in treating gynecological problems. Complicated clinical pictures involving multiple body systems is one of the situations where Extraordinary Vessels can be used. Normally, when having only one organ that is in disorder one would only need the treatment of that organ but when there are multiple organs involved then that would be a good time to use the Extraordinary Vessels. The same applies for a clinical picture that involves multiple channels such as sciatica that starts with the Bladder channel and then involves pain in the Gall Bladder and Stomach channels. In this case one can use the Yang Stepping Vessel (yang qiao mai) to treat all three channels. Other situations where the Extraordinary Vessels can be used is when there are confusing clinical pictures involving Deficiency-Excess or Hot-Cold. In these cases the Extraordinary Vessels' functioning as reservoirs providing qi to deficiencies and as reservoirs absorbing excesses comes into play. They can also be used in emotional problems such as the ren mai for mania after labour, the chong mai for restlessness and anxiety due to rebellious qi, the du mai for affecting the mind (will power of the Kidneys, Shen of the Heart, and Brain), and the yin and yang qiao mai for absorbing excess yang in the head with mental agitation. Also, some vessels (du mai, dai mai) can be used in neurological problems to activate the qi in the legs in such conditions as multiple sclerosis. The Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015, page 885-886",
      "exp_hant": "此臨床表現指向任脈，因任脈能治肺、滋養陰液、治療消化問題，同時也是治療婦科病症的重要脈道。當臨床表現涉及多個身體系統時，正是使用奇經八脈的時機之一。一般而言，若僅一個臟腑失調，只需針對該臟腑治療即可；但若涉及多個臟腑，則適合考慮運用奇經。同樣地，若病症涉及多條經脈，例如坐骨神經痛起於膀胱經，又牽連膽經與胃經之疼痛，此時便可選用陽蹺脈來同時治療這三條經脈。奇經八脈另一適用情況，是臨床表現虛實夾雜或寒熱錯雜、令人困惑時：此時奇經作為氣血儲存庫、既能補充不足又能吸納過剩的功能便能發揮作用。奇經亦可用於情志病症，例如產後躁狂用任脈；因氣逆而躁動不安、焦慮用衝脈；影響心神（腎之志、心之神與腦）用督脈；以及頭部陽氣過盛伴精神躁動時，用陰、陽蹺脈以吸收過盛之陽氣。此外，某些奇經（督脈、帶脈）亦可用於神經系統病症，如多發性硬化症等，以激發下肢之氣。The Foundations of Chinese Medicine，Maciocia著，2015年版，第885-886頁"
