      "exp_en": "Both the yin and yang qiao mai ascend and connect to the eyes at BL-1. Yin qiao mai brings yin energy to the eyes while the yang qiao mai brings yang energy to the eyes. Sleep problems such as insomnia (not enough yin, too much yang) and somnolence (not enough yang, too much yin). To treat insomnia, KI-6 (opening point yin qiao mai) is tonified while BL-62 (opening point for yang qiao mai) is reduced. To treat somnolence, the reverse is done with reducing KI-6 and tonifyng BL-62. In both treatments, needle BL-1 to establish the connection between yin and yang qiao mai to balance the yin and yang qi in the eyes.The Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015, page 923",
      "exp_hant": "陰蹺脈與陽蹺脈皆上行至眼部，於BL-1相聯絡。陰蹺脈將陰氣帶至眼部，陽蹺脈則將陽氣帶至眼部。睡眠問題可分為失眠（陰不足、陽偏盛）與嗜睡（陽不足、陰偏盛）兩類。治療失眠時，補KI-6（陰蹺脈開穴）並瀉BL-62（陽蹺脈開穴）；治療嗜睡時則相反，瀉KI-6並補BL-62。無論何種治療，皆需針刺BL-1，以建立陰蹺脈與陽蹺脈之間的聯繫，平衡眼部的陰陽之氣。The Foundations of Chinese Medicine，Maciocia著，2015年版，第923頁"
