      ],
      "exp_en": "From LI-6, the luo meridian separates from the primary meridian and connects with the Lung primary meridian. From DU-1 (changqiang), the luo-connecting meridian travels up the side of the spine to spread over the occiput. From ST-40 (fenglong), the luo-connecting meridian follows the Spleen primary meridian and travels to the nape of neck and throat. From BL-58 (feiyang), the luo-connecting meridian separates from the primary meridian and connects with the Kidney meridian. The Large Intestine luo goes to the jaw, teeth, and ear. At LI-6 the luo meridian separates from the primary meridian and connects with the Lung primary meridian. On the face, the Large Intestine luo separates and one branch goes to the teeth and another goes to the ear. At ST-40 the luo meridian separates from the primary meridian and connects with the Spleen primary. At the nape of the neck, the Stomach luo goes internally to terminate at the throat. ST-40 is an important point in treating neck pain associated with digestive issues, clearing the mind by eliminating Phlegm, and treating phlegm goiter. At BL-58 the luo meridian separates from the primary meridian and connects with the Kidney primary meridian. The du mai luo connects with the Bladder meridian at the scapular area. BL-58 is a distal point that treats sciatica and low back pain.A Manual of Acupuncture, Deadman, 2nd Edition, page 26",
      "exp_hant": "從LI-6分出，絡脈聯絡肺之正經；從長強分出，絡脈沿脊柱兩側上行，散佈於枕部；從豐隆分出，絡脈沿脾之正經而行，走向頸項與咽喉；從飛揚分出，絡脈聯絡腎之正經。大腸絡脈走向下頜、牙齒與耳部：在LI-6處，絡脈由正經分出並聯絡肺之正經，在面部分出一支走向牙齒，另一支走向耳部。在豐隆處，絡脈由正經分出並聯絡脾之正經，於頸項後方內行終止於咽喉；豐隆是治療伴隨消化問題之頸痛、化痰以清神志，以及治療痰核瘰癧的重要穴位。在飛揚處，絡脈由正經分出並聯絡腎之正經；督脈絡脈於肩胛部聯絡膀胱經；飛揚為遠端取穴，可治療坐骨神經痛與腰痛。A Manual of Acupuncture，Deadman著，第2版，第26頁"
    },
