      "exp_en": "1st Branch: A branch seperates from ST-5, descends to ST-12, goes to DU-14 and then descends through the diaphragm to REN-13 and REN-12 to enter the Stomach and connect to the Spleen. 2nd Branch: Another branch descends from ST-12 along the mamillary line as far as ST-18, passes 2 cun lateral to the midline along the navel to ST-30. 3rd Branch: originates from the orifice of the Stomach, descends within the abdomen, meets with the 2nd Branch at ST-30, goes to ST-31, descends along the lateral margin of the tibia to ST-45. 4th Branch: separates from ST-36 and terminates at the lateral aspect of the middle toe. A 5th Branch: seperates on the dorsum of the foot at ST-42 and terminates at the medial side of the tip of the big to at SP-1 where it links to the Spleen channelA Manual of Acupuncture, Deadman, 2nd Edition, page 125-126",
      "exp_hant": "第一分支：自大迎（ST-5）分出，下行至缺盆（ST-12），至大椎（DU-14），再下行穿過橫膈，至上脘（REN-13）、中脘（REN-12），入屬胃腑，並連絡脾臟。第二分支：另一分支自缺盆（ST-12）沿乳中線下行至乳根（ST-18），再旁開正中線2寸，沿臍旁下行至氣衝（ST-30）。第三分支：起於胃下口，於腹內下行，在氣衝（ST-30）處與第二分支會合，再行至髀關（ST-31），沿脛骨外側緣下行至厲兌（ST-45）。第四分支：自足三里（ST-36）分出，止於中趾外側。第五分支：於足背自衝陽（ST-42）分出，止於足大趾尖內側的隱白穴（SP-1），與脾經相連。（出處：A Manual of Acupuncture，Deadman，第2版，第125-126頁）"
