      ],
      "exp_en": "The Lung muscle channel spreads over the diaphragm. The Pericardium muscle channel binds at the diaphragm. The Pericardium muscle channel connection to the diaphragm explains the action of PC-6 on the symptoms of belching, hiccup, and sighing. The Heart muscle channel descends across the diaphragm. The Heart muscle channel is the only yin muscle channel of the arm that goes and terminates at the umbilicus. Only the Heart and Pericardium muscle channels go to the axilla. Only the Lung muscle channel goes to the front of the shoulder. The yin muscle channels of the arm start at their respective fingers similar to the primary channels and follow a similar path. The Lung muscle channel follows the antero-lateral aspect of the arms, travels to the shoulder anterior to LI-15 (jianyu), returns and goes to the chest, spread over the diaphragm, and converges on the ribs. The Lung muscle channel going to the chest muscles explains the chest tightness and discomfort with worry, sadness, and grief. The Pericardium muscle channel follows the anterior aspect of the arm, binds at the inner elbow, disperses in the chest, binds at the diaphragm, and binds below the axilla before descending to the ribs. The Heart muscle channel ascends the medial aspect of the arm to the axilla, goes across to the chest, descends through the diaphragm, and terminates at the navel. The Lung channel connects with the Heart and Pericardium muscle channels. The Heart and Pericardium muscle channels connect with the Lung muscle channel.A Manual of Acupuncture, Deadman, 2nd Edition, page 75, 211, 369; The Channels of Acupuncture, Maciocia, 2006, page 306",
      "exp_hant": "肺經筋散布於橫膈之上。心包經筋結於橫膈。心包經筋與橫膈的這層連結，說明了內關（PC-6）對噯氣、呃逆、嘆息等症狀的作用。心經筋則下行橫越橫膈。心經筋是手部三條陰經筋中唯一行至並止於肚臍者。只有心經筋與心包經筋行至腋窩。只有肺經筋行至肩前。手部的陰經筋與正經一樣，皆起於各自的手指，並依循相近的路徑。肺經筋沿手臂前外側循行，行至肩部、肩髃（LI-15）之前，再折返至胸部，散布於橫膈之上，並會聚於肋骨。肺經筋行至胸部肌肉，說明了憂愁、悲傷、哀慟時所出現的胸悶不適。心包經筋沿手臂前側循行，結於肘內側，散布於胸中，結於橫膈，並在下行至肋骨之前結於腋下。心經筋沿手臂內側上行至腋窩，橫越至胸部，下穿橫膈，止於肚臍。肺經與心經筋、心包經筋相連，心經筋與心包經筋亦與肺經筋相連。（出處：A Manual of Acupuncture，Deadman，第2版，第75、211、369頁；The Channels of Acupuncture，Maciocia，2006年版，第306頁）"
    },
