      "exp_en": "This is the best and most complete answer. The muscle channels are involved in cases of sprain, flaccidity, spasms, repetitive strain injury (qi stasis), and invasion of muscle channels by external pathogenic factors. Relatively superficial needling is done to treat muscle channels as the muscle channels are located on the exterior surface of the body. Superficial needling is used in Deficient conditions (dull muscle aches, flaccidity) with reinforcing method and in Excess conditions (severe pain, rigidity) with reducing method. The acupuncture treatment consists of using local points, distal points, and Ah Shi points. One method of treating the muscle channels in an Empty condition is to moxa on the achy-dull points and reduce points on the primary channel. If the muscle channel is in Excess the local painful points are drained-reduced while the points on the primary channel are tonified with moxa. Massage can be used to relieve Full conditions in the muscle channels (stiffness, cramp). In expelling external pathogenic factors from the muscle channels, use needling and cupping for Wind, needling and moxa in cases of Cold, and cupping and needling for Dampness. Gua sha eliminates Cold from the muscles. Cupping eliminates Cold and Qi and Blood stasis and also expels Wind. Plum blossom eliminates Blood stasis and Heat in the muscle channels.A Manual of Acupuncture, Deadman, 2nd Edition, page 26; The Channels of Acupuncture, Maciocia, 2006, page 324-326",
      "exp_hant": "這是最佳且最完整的答案。經筋病常見於扭傷、痿軟無力、抽搐痙攣、勞損（氣滯）以及外邪侵襲經筋等情況。由於經筋位於體表外層，治療時多採取較淺的針刺。虛證（痠痛隱隱、痿軟）以淺刺搭配補法，實證（劇痛、僵硬）則以淺刺搭配瀉法。針灸治療包括使用局部穴位、遠端穴位及阿是穴。治療虛性經筋病的方法之一，是在痠痛隱隱的穴位施灸，並於正經穴位上施以瀉法。若經筋屬實證，則局部痛點以瀉法瀉之，而正經穴位則以灸法補之。推拿可用於緩解經筋的實證（僵硬、抽筋）。在祛除侵襲經筋的外邪方面，風邪用針刺配合拔罐，寒邪用針刺配合艾灸，濕邪則用拔罐配合針刺。刮痧能袪除肌肉中的寒邪。拔罐能袪除寒邪及氣血瘀滯，亦能祛風。梅花針能袪除經筋中的血瘀與熱邪。（出處：A Manual of Acupuncture，Deadman，第2版，第26頁；The Channels of Acupuncture，Maciocia，2006年版，第324-326頁）"
