      "exp_en": "The record can only be changed by the person responsible for providing or evaluating the health service provided. When making a correction to the medical record, never write over or obliterate the passage when an entry to a medical record is made in error. Draw a single line through the incorrect information, keeping the original entry legible. Sign or initial and date the deletion. State the the reason for the correction above or in the margin. Document the correct information on the next line/space with the current date and time. Correction of electronic records also keep track of both the original entry and the correction with the current date, time, reason for the change and initials of person making the correction. When a hard copy is generated from an electronic record, both records must show the correction. Acupuncture Risk Management, CMS Press, Kailin, 1997 page 81",
      "exp_hant": "病歷只能由負責提供或評估該項醫療服務的人員更改。更正病歷時，若某項紀錄有誤，切勿將該段文字塗改或塗銷。應在錯誤資訊上劃一條單線，並保持原始紀錄仍可辨識。在刪除處簽名或簽署姓名縮寫並註明日期。在該處上方或欄外註明更正原因。將正確資訊記錄於下一行／空白處，並附上目前的日期與時間。電子病歷的更正，同樣須保留原始紀錄與更正內容，並註明目前的日期、時間、變更原因及更正者的姓名縮寫。若由電子病歷產生紙本，紙本與電子紀錄皆須顯示該項更正。（出處：Acupuncture Risk Management，CMS Press，Kailin，1997年版，第81頁）"
