      "exp_en": "This is Terminal-Yin (jue yin) stage. This is a Hot Above and Cold Below pattern. The treatment principle is to Clear Heat Above, Expel Cold Below, and Harmonize the Liver Channel. LR-3 drains excess Hot-yang energy from above. LR-3 in combination with LI-4 (the four gates) helps to regulate the ascending and descending of qi and helps to subdue the rebellious qi. LR-3 helps to calm the Mind by moving the stagnant Liver qi. To regulate the Cold below SP-4 and PC-6 are used. SP-4 harmonizes the Middle burner and regulates the intestines. PC-6 harmonizes the Stomach and Calms the Mind. SP-4 and PC-6 are the points which open the Penetrating Vessel (chong mai). Li Shi Zhen recommends the use of the chong mai for cold feet and feeling of heat in the face. Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015, page 762; 2005 Edition, page 718",
      "exp_hant": "此為厥陰階段，屬上熱下寒證。治療原則為清上熱、袪下寒，並調和肝經。太衝可疏泄上部過盛的熱陽之氣。太衝配合合谷（四關穴）有助於調節氣機的升降，並平息逆亂之氣。太衝亦能透過疏通鬱滯的肝氣以安神。至於調理下部之寒，則選用公孫與內關。公孫能和中焦、調腸胃，內關則能和胃、安神。公孫與內關為開啟衝脈的穴位。李時珍建議以衝脈治療足冷與面部發熱之症。（出處：Foundations of Chinese Medicine，Maciocia，2015年版，第762頁；2005年版，第718頁）"
