      "exp_en": "LU-10 can harmonize the relationship between the Lung and Stomach and the Lung and Heart. The Lung channel starts in the middle burner in the Stomach. LU-10 can clear the heat in the Lung which can be transmitted to the Stomach to produce tooth pain, for example, or to treat Stomach symptoms such as abdominal pain with inability to eat or drink. LU-10 can also treat the dual rebellion in both the Lung qi (cough) and Stomach qi (hiccup, vomiting). The Lung and Heart are connected. When there is Lung heat, the heat can affect the Heart and give rise to agitation and mental disturbance (anger, mania). LU-11 can clear Lung heat and benefit the throat. Though LU-11 clears heart agitation with cough, it does not have a strong influence on the Stomach. LU-10 is a ying-spring point and a Fire point. The actions of LU-10 are to benefit the throat, clear Lung heat, descend rebellious qi, and harmonize the Stomach and Heart. A Manual of Acupuncture, Deadman, 2nd Edition, page 89",
      "exp_hant": "魚際能調和肺與胃、肺與心之間的關係。肺經起於中焦之胃，魚際可清瀉肺熱，此熱可傳於胃而產生牙痛等症狀，或治療如腹痛不能食飲等胃部症狀。魚際亦能同時治療肺氣（咳嗽）與胃氣（呃逆、嘔吐）之雙重上逆。肺與心相通，肺熱時可影響於心，而引發躁動及神志不安（易怒、狂躁）等表現。少商能清肺熱、利咽喉。少商雖能清心躁並止咳，但對胃的作用不強。魚際為滎穴，亦屬火穴。魚際的作用為利咽喉、清肺熱、降逆氣，並調和胃與心。（出處：A Manual of Acupuncture，Deadman，第2版，第89頁）"
