    {
      "number": 885,
      "question_en": "A 37 year-old female patient has had scanty periods for the past six years. She also complained of dizziness, low back pain, and tinnitus. She sometimes feels cold. Her prescription drugs include Restasis (cyclosporine). The tongue did not have any coating and the pulse was thin. The acupuncture treatment included the points KI-7 (fu liu), moxa BL-23 (shen shu), ST-36 (zu san li), and REN-6 (qi hai). She was treated for three months through three menstrual cycles, after which she was evaluated. She reported that though she felt more energy she still did not see any improvement with her menstrual cycle. What would your treatment be now?",
      "question_hant": "一位37歲女性病患經量過少已持續六年。她同時主訴頭暈、腰痛及耳鳴，偶爾會感到怕冷。她所服用的處方藥物包括Restasis（環孢素）。舌無苔，脈細。針灸治療選用了復溜（KI-7）、灸腎俞（BL-23）、足三里（ST-36）及氣海（REN-6）等穴位。經過三個月、涵蓋三次月經週期的治療後進行評估，她表示雖然自覺體力有所改善，但月經週期仍未見任何進步。此時您會如何調整治療？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
