        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "Sticky-thick blood, yellow vaginal discharge, chest oppression, scanty-dark urine, feeling hot, thirst without desire to drink, sticky-yellow coating, and slippery pulse point to a damp-heat pattern in the Uterus. The excess heat makes the blood reckless. BL-22 and SP-9 resolve dampness. GB-41 and TB-5 regulate the Girdle Vessel which resolved lower burner dampness and heat. ST-29 drains dampness from the lower burner and regulates blood. Though SP-8 harmonizes the Spleen to resolve dampness, regulates the Uterus, and stops bleeding. SP-1 is a main point to strengthen the Spleen function to hold blood when there is bleeding from the uterus, bladder, or intestines. SP-1 can be used for bleeding due to a deficiency or excess such as heat. Moxa on SP-1 is an empirical method to stop uterine bleeding in all conditions, even hot patterns. The patient can be given a moxa stick to self-treat with moxa on SP-1. The other points mainly transform dampness which reinforce the other points in the prescription. Obstetrics and Gynecology in Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 1998, page 264; Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015, page 1001",
      "exp_hant": "血質黏稠、陰道分泌物色黃、胸悶、小便量少色深、自覺身熱、口渴不欲飲、舌苔黃膩、脈滑，皆提示子宮濕熱之證。熱邪過盛致使血行妄動。三焦俞（BL-22）與陰陵泉（SP-9）能化濕。足臨泣（GB-41）與外關（TB-5）調理帶脈，能化解下焦濕熱。歸來（ST-29）能從下焦引濕外洩並調血。地機（SP-8）雖能健脾化濕、調理子宮並止血，但隱白（SP-1）才是增強脾臟統血功能、以治療子宮、膀胱或腸道出血的主要穴位。隱白可用於治療因虛或因實（如熱）所致的出血。灸隱白是治療各種證型子宮出血、即便是熱證亦然的經驗用法。可教導病患使用艾條自行於隱白施灸。其餘穴位主要作用在於化濕，用以強化處方中其他穴位的效果。（出處：Obstetrics and Gynecology in Chinese Medicine，Maciocia，1998年版，第264頁；Foundations of Chinese Medicine，Maciocia，2015年版，第1001頁）"
