      "exp_en": "The Kidneys control will-power and motivation. BL-52 strengthens drive and determination in pursuing goals. When combined with BL-23, BL-52 stimulates will-power and lifts the spirit. The Liver roots the Ethereal Soul (hun) which is associated with the capacity of the hun to plan, to have a sense of direction, and to move towards one's dreams. BL-47 strengthens the hun. BL-49 helps to clear the mind (shen) and intellect (yi) of obsessive thoughts and worries. BL-42 settles the Corporeal Soul (po) and releases emotions stuck in the chest and diaphragm. BL-44 helps to relieve anxiety, mental restlessness, and insomnia. The Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015 Edition, page 1053",
      "exp_hant": "腎主志，主宰意志力與動力。志室（BL-52）能增強追求目標的幹勁與決心。志室配合腎俞（BL-23），能激發意志力並振奮精神。肝藏魂，魂具有規劃、確立方向感，並朝向理想邁進的能力。魂門（BL-47）能強化魂之功能。意舍（BL-49）有助於清除心神（神）與意中執著的思慮與憂愁。魄戶（BL-42）能安定魄，並釋放鬱結於胸膈的情緒。神堂（BL-44）有助於緩解焦慮、心神不寧及失眠。（出處：The Foundations of Chinese Medicine，Maciocia，2015年版，第1053頁）"
