      "exp_en": "Bladder Damp-Heat or Kidney Qi Deficient. BL-32 (ci liao) regulates the lower jiao and facilitates urination. The lower he-sea point of the san jiao BL-39 (wei yang) helps to regulate the water passages and urination. The front-mu point REN-3 (zhong ji) regulates and stabilizes the Bladder and urination. SP-6 (san yin jiao) harmonizes the three lower yin channels and regulates urination. BL-23 (shen shu) helps to facilitate Bladder function. BL-39 (wei yang), REN-3 (zhong ji), and SP-6 (san yin jiao) together can also drain Bladder Damp-Heat. Acupuncture a Comprehensive Text, Bensky, 1981, in section starting on page 652",
      "exp_hant": "膀胱濕熱證，或腎氣虛證。次髎（BL-32）能調理下焦並助小便通利。三焦下合穴委陽（BL-39）有助於調理水道並助小便。募穴中極（REN-3）能調理並穩定膀胱及小便功能。三陰交（SP-6）能調和下肢三條陰經並調理小便。腎俞（BL-23）有助於促進膀胱的功能。委陽（BL-39）、中極（REN-3）與三陰交（SP-6）三穴合用，亦能清瀉膀胱濕熱。（出處：Acupuncture a Comprehensive Text，Bensky，1981年版，第652頁起段落）"
    },
    {
      "number": 897,
      "question_en": "A 46 year-old female has a history of chronic heart disease. She was diagnosed with aortic insufficiency. Her symptoms include a two-year history of episodic palpitations and SOB. Even when she lies down and rests, the palpitations and SOB are severe. She was told that her heart rate is over 130 beats per minute. She cannot do any physical exercise as the slightest exertion causes severe discomfort and SOB. When seated she still has difficulty with breathing. She has a history of hospitalization for heart failure. Presently, her breathing has worsened with frequent episodes of wheezing when she exerts herself. She complains of feeling cold and easily catching colds. She complains that her whole body aches. She has poor sleep, easily waking up during the night. She is constipated and her urination is clear and scanty. Bowel movements occur every couple of days and the stools are moist. Complexion is dark and without any luster. The tongue is pale and purplish with a white and greasy coating. The pulse is thin and rapid. Blood pressure is 100/70, Pulse 138, Respirations 20, Temperature 98.6 F. The following tests will be required: color Doppler jet width, less than 25 of left ventricle outflow test, regurgitation volume less than 30 ml/beat, angiographic grade 1+. Chest x-ray shows cardiomegaly leftward and inferior in diameter. M-mode 2 dimensional Doppler shows premature closure of mitral valve. MRI shows a mitral valve disorder. She is diagnosed with aortic regurgitation. She is treated with PC-6 (nei guan), REN-12 (zhong wan), REN-6 (qi hai), and ST-36 (zu san li). She was treated three times and showed mild improvement in her heart rate and SOB and no change in urination. There were no changes in the pulse quality or tongue. Which point would you add to the prescription?",
      "question_hant": "一位46歲女性有慢性心臟病病史，並被診斷為主動脈瓣閉鎖不全。她的症狀包括陣發性心悸與呼吸急促，已持續兩年。即使臥床休息，心悸與呼吸急促仍然嚴重。醫師告知她的心跳速率超過每分鐘130下。她無法從事任何體能活動，即便輕微勞動也會引發嚴重不適與呼吸急促。即使坐著，她仍感呼吸困難。她曾因心衰竭而住院。目前她的呼吸狀況已惡化，勞動時常出現喘鳴。她主訴怕冷且容易感冒。她主訴全身痠痛。睡眠品質不佳，夜間容易驚醒。她有便秘，小便清而量少。大便每隔幾天一次，質地偏濕軟。面色晦暗無光澤。舌淡紫，苔白膩。脈細數。血壓100/70，脈搏138次／分，呼吸20次／分，體溫攝氏37度（華氏98.6度）。所需檢查包括：彩色都卜勒血流寬度、左心室流出道測值小於25、逆流容積小於每次跳動30毫升、血管攝影分級1+。胸部X光顯示心臟擴大，偏向左下方。M型二維都卜勒顯示二尖瓣提早關閉。核磁共振顯示二尖瓣病變。她被診斷為主動脈瓣逆流。治療選用內關（PC-6）、中脘（REN-12）、氣海（REN-6）及足三里（ST-36）。經三次治療後，心跳速率與呼吸急促皆略有改善，但小便情況無變化，脈象與舌象亦無改變。您會在處方中加入哪一個穴位？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "en": "REN-3 (zhong ji)",
          "hant": "中極",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "en": "ST-40 (feng long)",
          "hant": "豐隆",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "en": "LU-9 (tai yuan)",
          "hant": "太淵",
          "correct": true
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "en": "BL-17 (ge shu) and SP-10 (xue hai)",
          "hant": "膈俞與血海",
          "correct": false
        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "The 8-Principles diagnosis is Internal, Cold, Deficient. The organ pattern is Deficient Heart Yang and Deficient Lung qi. The treatment principle is Warm and Tonify Heart Yang and Tonify Lung qi. PC-6 regulates the zong chi (chest qi) and Stomach, removes any obstructions in the chest thereby relieving chest pain and palpitations, and calms the Spirit. When a patient is very weak as this patient, points on the middle and lower burner such as REN-12, REN-6, and ST-36 are selected to support the upper burner and to tonify the qi and yang of the body. These points did not address the other organ of the upper burner, the Lungs. LU-9 was added to regulate and tonify Lung qi and promote blood circulation as it is the influential point for the blood vessels. SP-10 and BL-17 treat Blood stasis (purplish tongue) but, since the manifestations of Blood stasis are not a strong component in this case, less significance is attached to the purplish tongue. The scanty urination is due to the yang being so weak failing to transform and move water or dampness. REN-3 is a point which treats scanty urination arising from damp-heat which is not a factor in this case. ST-40 transforms Phlegm which in this case is manifesting as a greasy white coating. The Phlegm is not playing a role in her current condition, which is one of deficiency and not excess and is given no importance, as tonifying the yang will resolve it. The lab studies (chest x-ray, Doppler, MRI) confirm an aortic regurgitation where the blood leaks back through the aortic valve because the valve does not close properly. Angiographic grade 1+ is a mild regurgitation (3+ is severe). Acupuncture Patterns and Practice, Eastland Press, 1993, Xuemai and Jingyi, Pages 176-179",
      "exp_hant": "八綱辨證為裡、寒、虛證。臟腑辨證為心陽虛與肺氣虛。治療原則為溫補心陽、補益肺氣。內關（PC-6）能調理宗氣與胃，消除胸中壅滯以緩解胸痛與心悸，並能安神。由於此病患體質十分虛弱，因此選用中焦與下焦的穴位，如中脘（REN-12）、氣海（REN-6）及足三里（ST-36），以扶助上焦，並補益全身之氣與陽。然而這些穴位並未處理上焦的另一臟——肺。因此加入太淵（LU-9），以調理並補益肺氣，並促進血液循環，因其為血脈之會穴（八會穴之脈會）。血海（SP-10）與膈俞（BL-17）用於治療血瘀（舌紫），但由於此病案中血瘀的表現並不明顯，舌質紫暗的意義相對較輕。小便量少是由於陽氣過於虛弱，無法正常氣化與運行水濕所致。中極（REN-3）是治療因濕熱所致小便量少的穴位，而此病案並無濕熱之因素。豐隆（ST-40）能化痰，而此病案中痰的表現為苔白膩。然而痰並非此病患目前病情中的主要病機，此證屬虛而非實，只要溫補陽氣，痰濕自可化解，故無須特別著重於此。相關檢驗（胸部X光、都卜勒、核磁共振）證實為主動脈瓣逆流，即因瓣膜無法正常閉合，導致血液經主動脈瓣逆流。血管攝影分級1+為輕度逆流（3+則為重度）。（出處：Acupuncture Patterns and Practice，Eastland Press，1993年版，Xuemai and Jingyi，第176-179頁）"
    },
    {
      "number": 898,
      "question_en": "A 65 year-old male patient has a history of migraine on the left side of the head. The headaches worsened when he drank too much coffee, ate spicy-hot foods, and was under stress with irritability. He had insomnia. The tongue was red. The pulse was deep and without strength. The first course of treatment was LR-3 (taichong), TB-5 (waiguan), SP-6 (sanyinjiao), GB-20 (fengchi), and left extra point taiyang. Five treatments were given. During evaluation, he reports that the head pain is reduced after each treatment but the improvement only lasts a couple of days after which time the pain returns to the original intensity. He notes that he is sleeping more deeply and is less irritable. The acupuncturist keeps the same prescription but he substitutes extra point taiyang for which scalp acupuncture point?",
      "question_hant": "一位65歲男性病患有偏頭痛病史，疼痛位於頭部左側。當他飲用過多咖啡、食用辛辣燥熱食物，或處於壓力與易怒狀態時，頭痛便會加重。他有失眠。舌紅，脈沉而無力。第一療程選用太衝（LR-3）、外關（TB-5）、三陰交（SP-6）、風池（GB-20）及左側太陽穴（經外奇穴）。共治療五次。評估時，他表示每次治療後頭痛皆有減輕，但改善僅維持數天，之後疼痛便回復至原本的強度。他提到自己睡得更沉，也較不易急躁。針灸師維持相同處方，但將太陽穴（經外奇穴）改用哪一個頭皮針穴位替代？",
