      "exp_en": "Spleen and Lung Qi Deficiency. The treatment principle is to tonify Lung and Spleen Qi. LU-9 (tai yuan) and BL-13 (fei shu) strengthen Lung qi. DU-12 (shen zhu) strengthens Lung qi particularly useful in chronic cases. ST-36 (zu san li), SP-3 (tai bai), BL-20 (pi shu) and BL-21 (wei shu) strengthen the middle jiao to promote the production of qi. LU-7 (lie que) can be added to tonify the Lungs and descend the Lung qi. REN-6 (qi hai) can be added to strengthen the body qi in general. Reinforcing method is used on all points. The Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015, page 614; 2005 Edition, page 581; 1989 Edition page 247",
      "exp_hant": "脾肺氣虛證。治療原則為補益肺脾之氣。太淵（LU-9）與肺俞（BL-13）能強健肺氣。身柱（DU-12）能強健肺氣，對慢性病症尤為適用。足三里（ST-36）、太白（SP-3）、脾俞（BL-20）與胃俞（BL-21）能健運中焦以促進氣的化生。可加入列缺（LU-7）以補肺並降肺氣。亦可加入氣海（REN-6）以整體強健身體之氣。各穴皆採用補法。（出處：The Foundations of Chinese Medicine，Maciocia，2015年版，第614頁；2005年版，第581頁；1989年版，第247頁）"
