      "number": 908,
      "question_en": "A 33 year-old woman had a successful home birth of her child. However, she now had a retained placenta which was not expelled 20 minutes after birth. Her complexion was dark-blue. She had lower abdominal pain which improved with hot compresses. She had a normal urinary flow. The tongue was pale. The pulse was deep-wiry-slow. She was treated at home with SP-8 (di ji), REN-4 (guan yuan), and BL-60 (kun lun). After a 15 minute treatment with reducing needle technique, the abdominal pain improved but the placenta was not expelled. Which is the best point that you would have added to the prescription?",
      "question_hant": "一位33歲女性在家順利生產後，出現胎盤滯留，產後20分鐘胎盤仍未娩出。她面色青暗，下腹疼痛，熱敷後可緩解。小便通暢正常。舌淡，脈沉弦遲。她在家中接受地機（SP-8）、關元（REN-4）及崑崙（BL-60）的治療。以瀉法針刺治療15分鐘後，腹痛改善，但胎盤仍未娩出。您會在處方中加入下列哪一個最合適的穴位？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "en": "GB-21 (jian jing)",
          "hant": "肩井",
          "correct": true
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "en": "REN-6 (qi hai)",
          "hant": "氣海",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "en": "BL-32 (ci liao)",
          "hant": "次髎",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "en": "SP-10 (xue hai)",
          "hant": "血海",
          "correct": false
        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "A retained placenta is most often due to deficient qi arising from the mother being exhausted due to labor or to blood stasis. The placenta is normally delivered at the third stage of labor a couple of minutes after the birth. If it goes past 20 minutes it is considered prolonged. In this patient, we have an invasion of Cold during the labor leading to Blood stasis in the Uterus. SP-8 regulates the Uterus, moves Blood, and stops pain. REN-4 regulates the Uterus and invigorates Blood. BL-60 descends the qi and is a point selected for labor, retained placenta, and abdominal pain. GB-21 is an empirical point for a retained placenta and help delivery. GB-21 has a strong qi descending action. SP-10 invigorates the Blood but does not a direct action on the placenta. REN-6 is for tonifying the qi and yang of the body. BL-32 regulates the lower burner, facilitates urination and bowel movement, regulates menstruation, and stops leucorrhea. One of the possible causes for retained placenta is due to a full bladder and encouraging urination can help but this patient did not have that problem. If the acupuncture did not resolve the issue, then \"placenta accretia\" where the placenta adheres to the uterine wall, medical attention should be sought. Obstetrics and Gynecology in Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 1998, page 567",
      "exp_hant": "胎盤滯留最常見的原因，是產程中母體耗氣所致的氣虛，或是血瘀。胎盤通常於產程第三期、產後數分鐘內娩出，若超過20分鐘則視為滯留過久。此病患屬產程中感受寒邪，導致子宮血瘀之證。地機（SP-8）能調理子宮、行血止痛。關元（REN-4）能調理子宮並活血。崑崙（BL-60）能降氣，是用於分娩、胎盤滯留及腹痛的常用穴位。肩井（GB-21）為治療胎盤滯留、助產的經驗用穴，具有強力的降氣作用。血海（SP-10）能活血，但對胎盤並無直接作用。氣海（REN-6）用於補益全身之氣與陽。次髎（BL-32）能調理下焦、助小便與大便通暢、調經並止帶，然而此病患並無此類問題。胎盤滯留的可能原因之一是膀胱脹滿，此時鼓勵排尿有所助益，但此病患並無此問題。若針灸治療仍未能解決問題，應考慮「胎盤植入」（placenta accreta，胎盤附著於子宮壁）的可能，此時應尋求醫療協助。（出處：Obstetrics and Gynecology in Chinese Medicine，Maciocia，1998年版，第567頁）"
    },
