      "exp_en": "Sciatica is due to qi obstruction arising from Wind, Cold, or Dampness lodging in the channels. If Wind is predominant, the pain moves around. If cold is the pathogen, then the pain is intense. If Dampness, then the pain is fixed and heavy. If the Blood becomes congealed due to the obstruction becoming chronic, the disorder is established and will be difficult to resolve. The scalp points chosen were correct but should have been administered on the opposite side (right side) as it was the left leg that was affected. The upper fifth sensory line treats the lower limb, head and trunk area. The leg motor-sensory area treats paralysis, pain or lower limb numbness, back pain, nocturnal emission, and prolapsed uterus. The second and third fifth of the motor area treats the upper limb while the lower two fifth of the sensory area treats the face. The upper fifth of the sensory area treats the lower limb, head, and trunk area.Acupuncture A Comprehensive Text, Bensky, 1981, page 500, 612",
      "exp_hant": "坐骨神經痛是由風、寒、濕邪滯留經絡，導致氣機阻滯所致。若以風邪為主，疼痛遊走不定；若為寒邪，則疼痛劇烈；若為濕邪，則疼痛固定而沉重。若阻滯日久導致血液凝滯，病情便會纏綿難癒。所選頭皮針穴位本身正確，但應施於對側（右側），因患病部位為左腿。感覺區上五分之一主治下肢、頭部及軀幹部位。下肢運動感覺區主治癱瘓、下肢疼痛或麻木、腰痛、遺精及子宮脫垂。運動區中五分之二（第二、三個五分之一）主治上肢，感覺區下五分之二主治顏面部。感覺區上五分之一則主治下肢、頭部及軀幹。參考資料：《Acupuncture A Comprehensive Text》，Bensky，1981年，第500、612頁。"
