      "number": 914,
      "question_en": "A 32 year-old female has been referred for acupuncture treatment for external strabismus. The treatment given is GB-20 (feng chi), LI-4 (he gu), and extra point qiu hou. The patient is not improving. The patient's case was reviewed by the clinical acupuncture team. A change of prescription was recommended. Which of the following prescription was chosen?",
      "question_hant": "一名32歲女性因外斜視轉介接受針灸治療。所給予的治療為風池、合谷及經外奇穴球後。患者未見改善，其病例經臨床針灸團隊審查後，建議更換處方。下列何者為所選之新處方？",
      "image": null,
