          "hant": "百會",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "en": "TB-5 (wai guan)",
          "hant": "外關",
          "correct": false
        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "The 8-Principles diagnosis is Channel and Interior, neither Hot or Cold, Excess. The etiology is Blood Stasis. The pattern according to channels-collaterals is Obstruction of the Du Mai and the Greater Yang Channels. The treatment principle is Remove Blood Stasis and Channel Obstructions, Regulate Qi and Alleviate Pain. DU-16 removes improves qi and blood circulation in the brain and treats dizziness. BL-12 is selected as a near distal point for removing obstruction in the tai yang channel. BL-10 is local point to regulate qi and blood circulation. SI-3 opens the du mai, promotes yang of body, improves brain function, and treats the occipital area. The combination of BL-10 and SI-3 combines foot and hand tai yang points and they affect the Bladder channel and du mai to treat the neck and occipital area. TB-5 and GB-41 are points that treat the lateral side of the body and head. DU-20 is not as good as choice as SI-3 as the latter complements the foot tai yang points and DU-16 is more local to the problem. In an MRI, white dots indicate tiny hemorrhages known as microhemorrhages. These white dots are often seen after a collision or after falling from a height. The small white dots can also be seen In persons fifty or older often due to aging.Acupuncture Patterns and Practice, Eastland Press, 1993, Xuemai and Jingyi, Pages 67-71",
      "exp_hant": "八綱辨證為經絡與裡證，非熱非寒，屬實證。病因為血瘀。經絡辨證屬督脈與足太陽經受阻。治療原則為活血化瘀、疏通經絡、行氣止痛。DU-16 (feng fu) 風府可改善腦部氣血循環並治療頭暈。BL-12 (feng men) 風門為近端遠道取穴，用以疏通太陽經之阻滯。BL-10 (tian zhu) 天柱為局部穴，可調理氣血循環。SI-3 (hou xi) 後谿可通督脈、振奮周身之陽氣、改善腦部功能，並主治枕部病症。天柱與後谿合用，結合足太陽與手太陽兩經穴位，作用於膀胱經與督脈，可治療頸部與枕部病症。TB-5 (wai guan) 外關與 GB-41 (zu lin qi) 足臨泣則主治身體及頭部之側面病症。DU-20 (bai hui) 百會不如後谿為佳選擇，因後谿能與足太陽經穴相輔相成，而風府則較偏局部作用。核磁共振中的白色斑點代表微小出血，即所謂微出血點，常見於撞擊或高處墜落後，亦常見於五十歲以上者，多因老化所致。參考資料：《Acupuncture Patterns and Practice》，Eastland Press，1993年，Xuemai and Jingyi篇，第67-71頁。"
