      "exp_en": "The extra-ordinary stepping vessels yang qiao mai and yin qiao mai help to balance the left and right side of the body. The yang qiao mai balance the left and right yang channels and the yin qiao mai balance the left and right side of the yin channels. The yang qiao mai goes to the the shoulder (LI-15, LI-16, SI-10). The point BL-62 regulates the yang qiao mai and helps to balance both sides of the body. It can be selected to treat one leg longer than the other, one hip higher, or shoulder higher than the other. BL-62 is the opening and beginning point for the yang qiao mai. BL-62 removes channel obstructions, benefits the eyes, opens the yang stepping vessel, harmonize the left and right side of the yang stepping vessel, extinguish interior wind, subdue rebellious qi from the head, and calm the mind.The Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015 Edition, page 925, 1057",
