      "exp_en": "Acupuncture treatment can use bilateral or unilateral needling. In most point selection methods, bilateral needling is the main method. Maciocia uses unilateral, cross-over needling to move Qi and Blood and bilateral needling to strengthen Qi and nourish the Blood. Point selection to balance the left and right side of the body has two aspects: 1) balancing right and left when treating joint problems on one side of the body. When treating a joint problem, the points used will be on the side of the joint problem. For example, in treating a right shoulder problem with right LI-15, LI-11, and LI-4, one can needle left LU-7 to balance right and left, yin and yang. Or if the patient had a shoulder problem and also had Spleen disorder, one could needle the left side SP-6. 2) balancing right and left by using unilateral points to get a specific result. One reason for this selection would be to reduce the number of needles used on a patient. An example of unilateral needling would be to needle PC-6 on the left and LR-3 on the right or ST-44 on the right and LI-4 on the left. Unilateral needling is especially effective when combining points with the same polarity, with one on the arm and the other on the leg, that is within the same six division (taiyang, yangming, shaoyang, taiyin, shaoyin, jueyin). An example of cross-over unilateral needling would be for shaoyang headaches to select TB-5 on one side and GB-43 on the other or LI-4 and ST-36 to regulate the rising and descending of qi. This technique can also be used to treat joint problems. For example, right wrist pain treated with TB-4 combined with left GB-40. Another example, is when activating the extraordinary channels, using the master point one side and the couple point on the other side (eg LU-7 on the right and KI-6 on the left).Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015, page 1204-1206",
      "exp_hant": "針灸治療可採雙側或單側取穴。多數選穴方法以雙側取穴為主。馬萬里主張以單側交叉取穴來行氣活血，以雙側取穴來補氣養血。平衡身體左右兩側的選穴原則有兩個面向：一是治療單側關節病變時之左右平衡，此時所選穴位會在患病關節之同側。例如治療右肩病變，取右側 LI-15 肩髃、LI-11 曲池、LI-4 合谷，同時可於左側加刺 LU-7 列缺以平衡左右、陰陽；又若患者除肩部問題外還兼有脾臟病症，則可於左側加刺 SP-6 三陰交。二是運用單側取穴以達特定療效而平衡左右，其中一個理由是減少患者所需針刺之針數。單側取穴之例，如左側刺 PC-6 內關、右側刺 LR-3 太衝，或右側刺 ST-44 內庭、左側刺 LI-4 合谷。單側取穴尤其適用於同屬一組六經（太陽、陽明、少陽、太陰、少陰、厥陰）且極性相同、一在手臂一在腿部的穴位配伍。交叉單側取穴之例，如治療少陽頭痛，一側取 TB-5 外關，另一側取 GB-43 俠溪；或以 LI-4 合谷與 ST-36 足三里調節氣機升降。此技巧亦可用於治療關節病變，例如右腕疼痛以右側 TB-4 陽池配合左側 GB-40 丘墟治療。另一範例則是在啟動奇經時，一側取主穴、另一側取配穴（如右側取 LU-7 列缺、左側取 KI-6 照海）。參考資料：《Foundations of Chinese Medicine》，Maciocia，2015年版，第1204-1206頁。"
